{"id":"7f8dd4c0-0d39-45db-8ef4-bb0642488ae2","expr":"url.getPort() >= -1","rationale":"Port number is between -1 and 65535 but at least -1 to indicate no port, relevant to forming URI.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(URL):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.409151230Z"}
{"id":"1557fd84-5051-4cfe-8fff-03d257a130c5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"This method extracts an archive URL from the given jarUrl. Since the method returns a URL on all code paths from the snippet, result should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#extractArchiveURL(URL):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.412985799Z"}
{"id":"bf3aeb1b-c125-44e5-b4a4-c16b22f6b61d","expr":"result.toString().startsWith(jarUrl.getProtocol())","rationale":"The returned URL is extracted from the input jarUrl and likely shares the same protocol prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#extractArchiveURL(URL):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.412985799Z"}
{"id":"a4276d98-8458-43a5-9801-cc24ce3424aa","expr":"jarUrl.getFile().contains(result.getFile())","rationale":"The method extracts a substring of jarUrl's file component to produce the result URL.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#extractArchiveURL(URL):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.412985799Z"}
{"id":"bfef3fb6-279d-4977-8d43-66f09725c21c","expr":"location != null","rationale":"The method uses location with StringUtils.replace, so location must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.407306406Z"}
{"id":"bf96ba29-b3e0-42a9-82b5-e0c7b878747f","expr":"location != null","rationale":"The location parameter must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException when calling StringUtils.cleanPath.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.420885271Z"}
{"id":"2463d792-2849-4248-ae23-3aa77f589351","expr":"url != null && result != null && result.toString().equals(url.toString())","rationale":"The method returns a URI constructed from the URL's string, so their string representations match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(URL):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.411429138Z"}
{"id":"e4b448ec-52f5-4ebe-8f90-b43c40a92fe1","expr":"!location.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method will attempt to construct a URI from the location and then convert to URL, empty string would be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.420885271Z"}
{"id":"4c5648a5-2ed9-48c1-8521-e1bf10e852e9","expr":"location.indexOf(' ') >= -1","rationale":"indexOf returns -1 if space not found, otherwise a non-negative index.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.407306406Z"}
{"id":"f704422f-7778-43f0-a557-40dc473235bc","expr":"!result.isAbsolute() || (result.getScheme() != null && result.getScheme().length() > 0)","rationale":"An absolute URI always has a non-empty scheme.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(URL):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.411429138Z"}
{"id":"b4e4e4a6-8042-4427-bdf7-8b7f53380bad","expr":"location.indexOf('\\0') == -1","rationale":"Null characters are illegal in URLs and likely cause exceptions or malformed URLs.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.420885271Z"}
{"id":"de9f3881-ebb3-4e58-bc28-aa1a70ca07db","expr":"location.indexOf(' ') == -1","rationale":"Spaces in a URL string are typically not valid and can lead to failures in URI or URL construction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.420885271Z"}
{"id":"951aafab-b8fc-4d97-8cd9-fab455336e23","expr":"location.indexOf(':') > 0","rationale":"The presence of ':' indicates that location may include a scheme component as expected in URLs and URIs.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.420885271Z"}
{"id":"8bc1b258-acbd-4461-a2a8-1304629f0173","expr":"url.toURI().equals(result)","rationale":"Since the method returns toURI(url.toString()), it should be equivalent to url.toURI().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(URL):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.411429138Z"}
{"id":"c2793296-b98e-4e62-8287-72bb1b83bf32","expr":"result.getRawSchemeSpecificPart().equals(url.getFile())","rationale":"The URI is created from the URL string, thus the scheme specific parts should correspond.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(URL):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.411429138Z"}
{"id":"5a30407a-95d3-4dbc-b573-2fddaf23484b","expr":"!result.isOpaque() || (result.getScheme() != null && !result.getScheme().isEmpty())","rationale":"Opaque URIs by definition have a scheme specified.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(URL):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.411429138Z"}
{"id":"8ba12d31-6e0f-4bb0-bb45-c86a769afded","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a URL object constructed from the 'location', so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.435985159Z"}
{"id":"74ee65a0-93d7-4310-8023-a7f20a1cfbb5","expr":"(location != null) && (result.toString().contains(location) || result.toString().equals(location))","rationale":"The URL returned is constructed from the given 'location', so the string form of 'result' should reflect 'location'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.435985159Z"}
{"id":"8b16d35f-2672-42e9-8207-6755d489430f","expr":"result.getProtocol() != null && !result.getProtocol().isEmpty()","rationale":"Constructed URLs must have a non-null, non-empty protocol part.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.435985159Z"}
{"id":"7d44fb20-62c5-440e-b40c-6750c38fadd3","expr":"location.length() >= 0","rationale":"The length of any String is always >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.407306406Z"}
{"id":"73fd8164-f836-458a-9db7-bc57475e0838","expr":"root != null","rationale":"The method calls root.toString() and uses root as a base URL, so root must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.436065450Z"}
{"id":"88bec789-143e-4fa0-bf8a-1c6bd02220c7","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new URI constructed from the location string, so result must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.426702964Z"}
{"id":"1b56cc10-fa0a-4a5a-95ad-28ae0d64dece","expr":"result.toString().equals(location == null ? null : location.replace(\" \", \"%20\"))","rationale":"The URI's string form should be the location string with spaces replaced by %20.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.426702964Z"}
{"id":"6b859b45-c0c7-48c2-9ef8-b3e3b3831a1b","expr":"location == null || location.contains(\" \") || result.toString().equals(location)","rationale":"If location has spaces, replaced by %20; if no spaces or null, toString may equal location.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.426702964Z"}
{"id":"b7420a21-ac39-4506-8f91-6739e0fb6eda","expr":"result.isAbsolute() || !location.startsWith(\"/\")","rationale":"Absolute URI characteristic is related to how the location string is formed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.426702964Z"}
{"id":"a63efd9c-fd1f-418f-853f-8be83e95c504","expr":"result.getScheme() == null || location.startsWith(result.getScheme())","rationale":"The location string format relates to the URI scheme extracted.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.426702964Z"}
{"id":"696164db-5fb4-4e93-ad35-f17618a10909","expr":"messageDigest != null && messageDigest.getAlgorithm() != null && !messageDigest.getAlgorithm().isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method updates the MessageDigest, it should be initialized with a valid algorithm.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.442586076Z"}
{"id":"4dd59e64-36cf-43e0-a448-c1d7e62fa5cb","expr":"messageDigest.getDigestLength() > 0","rationale":"Digest length indicates output size; it must be positive for a valid instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.442586076Z"}
{"id":"4bad3b6c-8df7-48b7-af4f-2ff529356e32","expr":"messageDigest != null","rationale":"The method calls messageDigest.update(byte), so messageDigest cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.440763485Z"}
{"id":"92d33fda-c0be-4bc3-9e51-4daebb80cfaf","expr":"messageDigest.digest() != null","rationale":"After update, the digest method returns computed data, which must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.442586076Z"}
{"id":"34d5f27a-7c5d-4fe9-83cf-f9e9cec9d013","expr":"messageDigest.toString() != null","rationale":"Calling toString() on MessageDigest should never return null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.442586076Z"}
{"id":"ddc69577-321f-4977-ad03-56cd49e2ba30","expr":"messageDigest.getAlgorithm().length() > 0","rationale":"Algorithm name must be a non-empty string representing the algorithm used.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.442586076Z"}
{"id":"7fd84137-2d13-4795-ac70-f929bbd6d88c","expr":"len >= 0","rationale":"Since len indicates the number of bytes to update, it cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.445085752Z"}
{"id":"0d34915d-f411-4efb-8b5e-9b9595991661","expr":"messageDigest != null","rationale":"The method uses messageDigest.update(), so the messageDigest must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.445085752Z"}
{"id":"e0ef0abc-ddf9-4d00-8044-aabf6667bba2","expr":"(len == 0) || (messageDigest.getAlgorithm() != null)","rationale":"If len is zero, no update occurs and no invariant on algorithm is needed; otherwise, messageDigest usually has a non-null algorithm.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.445085752Z"}
{"id":"f1762a40-b0e9-48fd-b433-4f8330aab8a5","expr":"relativePath != null","rationale":"relativePath is passed to StringUtils.replace and other StringUtils methods, which require a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.436065450Z"}
{"id":"1a8fb67c-a648-46fd-8c39-e105fd9944b9","expr":"messageDigest != null","rationale":"messageDigest must be non-null to update it later in the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.445872093Z"}
{"id":"47c76c09-4ed6-49ad-aa2c-c145f8df9404","expr":"len >= 0","rationale":"Length parameter should be non-negative indicating a valid byte count.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.445872093Z"}
{"id":"7df771cb-fed2-41ae-82ee-3640748e0499","expr":"len == 0 || len > 0","rationale":"This invariant restates that len is a non-negative number.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.445872093Z"}
{"id":"269071d0-6740-4b6d-ac59-6e9a663ad646","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a new URL object created using the URL constructor, the result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.447194442Z"}
{"id":"71612561-48ec-4796-8787-3ceb703018de","expr":"result.toString().startsWith(root.toString())","rationale":"The method creates result relative to root, so typically the result URL string starts with the root URL string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.447194442Z"}
{"id":"431b8441-86e0-415f-b2e8-d31f71616a06","expr":"root.toString().length() > 0","rationale":"root.toString() represents the base URL string and should be non-empty for a valid URL path manipulation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.436065450Z"}
{"id":"de70d9d6-e2f3-4013-9481-20af614db044","expr":"relativePath.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length must be non-negative; trivial but valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.436065450Z"}
{"id":"a4eadb30-f4b6-41fc-9894-bb677ff49441","expr":"messageDigest.getAlgorithm() != null","rationale":"The messageDigest instance needs a valid algorithm configured to perform update operations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.440763485Z"}
{"id":"d9bd9555-63f0-4fb7-84da-b89aca748c3f","expr":"!messageDigest.getAlgorithm().isEmpty()","rationale":"A messageDigest instance should have a non-empty algorithm name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.440763485Z"}
{"id":"099e8b2a-070a-439c-893e-b7220b704b39","expr":"messageDigest.getProvider() != null","rationale":"The MessageDigest instance should have a cryptographic provider configured.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:32.440763485Z"}
{"id":"c24ec8fd-5760-4aad-af9a-0a347d50df8e","expr":"pattern == null || str == null || !pattern.isEmpty()","rationale":"If pattern and str are non-null, pattern is likely not empty for valid matching.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.863669750Z"}
{"id":"40c062aa-845c-4d6b-982c-3f8e13dcabe4","expr":"pattern == null || pattern.indexOf('*') >= -1","rationale":"Pattern may contain wildcard '*', indexOf >= -1 always true but states intent.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.863669750Z"}
{"id":"d159321f-78db-4c05-bfc5-4c24403d664b","expr":"str == null || str.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative if string is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.863669750Z"}
{"id":"4e3e605b-70a7-4a68-8591-ff1a16531d8d","expr":"! (pattern == null && str == null)","rationale":"Based on contract, both null inputs means false return.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.863669750Z"}
{"id":"943c6c88-d5a6-42f1-a3e9-7028e51fd519","expr":"(pattern != null && str != null) || pattern == null || str == null","rationale":"The inputs may both be non-null or either be null, capturing exhaustive possibilities.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.863669750Z"}
{"id":"b37f8dd9-9fdb-422e-ad03-0eb81702001d","expr":"result == false || (pattern != null && str != null)","rationale":"From the contract, the method returns false if either parameter is null, so if the result is true both must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.866226814Z"}
{"id":"5078f472-fa2a-400d-b0ec-92cb1325874a","expr":"!result || (pattern.length() >= 0 && str.length() >= 0)","rationale":"If the method returns true, both strings must be non-null (implied by previous invariant), so their length properties exist and are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.866226814Z"}
{"id":"5c3d7ce4-ac9f-4031-8357-1a81e85616f9","expr":"result == false || !pattern.isEmpty()","rationale":"It is generally expected that to produce a match, a pattern is non-empty. Empty pattern likely leads to false result or special behavior.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.866226814Z"}
{"id":"f9c6c12c-fb09-4a93-9aad-4415d1acbfb8","expr":"result == false || !str.isEmpty()","rationale":"To match, the string must generally not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.866226814Z"}
{"id":"13ba842b-be8f-4b75-9045-3b77d7d820c8","expr":"pattern != null || str == null","rationale":"The first check in the method is if pattern or str is null, the method returns false, so logically if pattern is null then str should be null or method won't proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.870210915Z"}
{"id":"13fd2078-28f7-427b-ac6c-629e76ef9c95","expr":"str != null || pattern == null","rationale":"From the null checks, if str is null then pattern must be null or method won't proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.870210915Z"}
{"id":"3e1159b7-4147-4693-88c2-208016406cbb","expr":"ignoreCase == true || ignoreCase == false","rationale":"ignoreCase is boolean so inherently either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.870210915Z"}
{"id":"ed427f9b-d9d6-4fe6-8e74-f7b5baeaddea","expr":"str != null && pattern != null","rationale":"The method starts by returning false if either pattern or str is null, so at the method entry, both may be possibly null but for meaningful processing both should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.870210915Z"}
{"id":"37200718-6cea-49fa-a1a7-1150f01bf528","expr":"pattern.indexOf('*') >= -1","rationale":"indexOf returns -1 if character is not found or non-negative integer if found, so the value is always >= -1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.870210915Z"}
{"id":"03495a3c-783c-4c52-95b8-38627a6e36d9","expr":"pattern != null","rationale":"The pattern string is expected to be non-null for meaningful substring match.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#checkStartsWith(String,String,int,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:33.874626488Z"}
