{"id":"4da6bdc9-6692-4923-94db-8c8e76e0f785","expr":"dtd.length() >= 0","rationale":"The input string length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.738084050Z"}
{"id":"9376ba01-a42e-44df-a48d-4a90fc4b4a7f","expr":"!target.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"The target string should not contain '<?' which denotes start of XML processing instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.737872822Z"}
{"id":"774492e1-a8b6-45bd-9e74-3db30a69e7aa","expr":"data != null","rationale":"To safely create an ignorable space event from data, the data string should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.746667680Z"}
{"id":"a919c6ee-7b6b-4050-ac81-50950a1470f9","expr":"data.trim().isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method is ignorableWhitespaceInternal, the input string likely contains only whitespace, so trimming it results in empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.746667680Z"}
{"id":"ae69bb59-c02d-4957-b98f-c249e01fb22e","expr":"dtd != null","rationale":"The method creates a DTD event using dtd string and adds it to eventWriter, so dtd must be a valid non-null XML DTD string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.749088127Z"}
{"id":"ebb79c8f-f0e1-4437-93b0-12a8738fba6c","expr":"dtd.contains(\"[\") == dtd.contains(\"]\")","rationale":"An internal subset DTD syntax uses square brackets, so if one bracket exists, the other should as well for well-formedness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.749088127Z"}
{"id":"8f75f762-0596-4173-85f6-ff5d051c29ce","expr":"dtd.length() > 0","rationale":"An empty string does not form a valid DTD; thus the string should have length greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.749088127Z"}
{"id":"b9173e15-0426-4e11-8cb9-6ef36231d292","expr":"!dtd.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"Processing instructions are a separate XML construct and unlikely part of a DTD content string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.749088127Z"}
{"id":"996a5fa8-1e70-4fe7-a53d-2b72694a0d3e","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The data string can be empty but is generally non-null to avoid creating invalid processing instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.739298676Z"}
{"id":"2bbca5f6-c571-46ca-b863-8557b9d41fbc","expr":"target.length() <= 1000","rationale":"Targets are usually short strings, and imposing an upper bound can reflect typical usage.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.739298676Z"}
{"id":"eaea30da-1e11-43e7-ab4e-260e045f26a4","expr":"comment != null","rationale":"The method uses 'comment' to create a comment event, so 'comment' should be a valid non-null string at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.758948160Z"}
{"id":"e451f1ad-89d5-4920-b4fb-6f85441f28c4","expr":"comment.trim().length() >= 0","rationale":"String length of trimmed comment is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.758948160Z"}
{"id":"6743d9e5-667a-4461-b150-ec04edda9743","expr":"!comment.contains(\"--\")","rationale":"XML comments cannot contain double hyphens '--', so comment shouldn't include that.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.758948160Z"}
{"id":"a97cb4e6-a159-4379-ba3c-35ed8f44aa89","expr":"!comment.startsWith(\"-\") && !comment.endsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"XML comment syntax forbids starting or ending with a hyphen, enforced by the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.758948160Z"}
{"id":"cde04f67-b31d-4031-a2c3-3f32fe957942","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Entity names passed to this method should be valid non-null strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.763067395Z"}
{"id":"9e2ec7ad-2191-404f-bac8-f0a32159ed9d","expr":"!name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Skipped entity names typically have meaningful length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.763067395Z"}
{"id":"d6bce5a5-5d4f-42a3-a68e-ee55766c37ce","expr":"name.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"XML entity names are expected to have visible characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.763067395Z"}
{"id":"6d59db0f-1a68-4481-9c31-0d7fe3a5dd26","expr":"name.equals(name.trim())","rationale":"XML names conventionally must not have leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.763067395Z"}
{"id":"a25bdf89-b431-4d0d-871c-c3f1f6827135","expr":"result >= -1","rationale":"The line number returned by XML parsers is usually a positive integer or -1 to indicate unknown or unavailable line number.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getLineNumber():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.766937090Z"}
{"id":"e242a9a8-b203-46b9-b822-a7dd76646c83","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0 || name == null || name.length() == 0","rationale":"The method parameter 'name' may be null or empty since the method is empty, but if name is non-null, it should have a defined length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#skippedEntityInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.772679431Z"}
{"id":"e5505613-0dcf-47dd-acff-789dd21849ce","expr":"result == -1","rationale":"The method unconditionally returns -1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getCharacterOffset():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.780842910Z"}
{"id":"291adfdf-60f4-49e3-8c1e-51b099c3e71f","expr":"result < 0","rationale":"Since result is always -1, it is negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getCharacterOffset():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.780842910Z"}
{"id":"263e9d16-1d02-4f44-92f4-185fc3bd735f","expr":"comment != null","rationale":"To create a valid XML comment, the comment string should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.786441751Z"}
{"id":"8e961d35-9384-40c3-b5af-4f99dbbd3ed9","expr":"comment.indexOf(\"--\") == -1","rationale":"The string used for an XML comment should not contain the sequence \"--\" as it is invalid in XML comments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.786441751Z"}
{"id":"257df2f5-99fe-4b2b-9897-967283ef0ae4","expr":"comment.length() >= 0","rationale":"By definition, string length is never negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.786441751Z"}
{"id":"5edb8e25-53fc-4604-8dff-665af73d62a1","expr":"!comment.endsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"To prevent invalid XML comment termination that might interfere with comment syntax.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.786441751Z"}
{"id":"f8b78549-dcfc-45c4-81f6-affef2f7851b","expr":"!comment.startsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"To comply with XML comment specification that doesn't allow starting with hyphen.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.786441751Z"}
{"id":"8a246671-cba3-4c27-8998-81ab426aac92","expr":"result == null || result.length() > 0","rationale":"The public identifier returned by the locator is expected to be null or a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getPublicId():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.790762505Z"}
{"id":"5fffa11a-8303-4de2-9eb1-a83c591b57ef","expr":"result == null || !result.trim().isEmpty()","rationale":"If a publicId is returned, it is typically a meaningful non-empty value and not just whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getPublicId():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.790762505Z"}
{"id":"6a33e0c9-34b6-44b1-b681-64ecc4b9aaad","expr":"result == null || result.indexOf('\"') == -1","rationale":"Since public IDs are identifiers, they usually don't contain quotes to avoid XML conflicts.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getPublicId():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.790762505Z"}
{"id":"0326f48f-dcdf-46ee-94f5-e1feb4a9003e","expr":"result >= -1","rationale":"The column number returned by locator.getColumnNumber() is usually non-negative or -1 if unavailable.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getColumnNumber():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.795740537Z"}
{"id":"210f4e99-e1db-45e0-96fb-e56668b969b5","expr":"result == null || result.length() > 0","rationale":"The system identifier, if present, should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getSystemId():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.799364951Z"}
{"id":"34d8ba27-7007-40d8-b6cd-cc0f9a18850f","expr":"result == null || result.indexOf(' ') < 0","rationale":"The system identifier generally does not contain spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#getSystemId():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.799364951Z"}
{"id":"1ba3a06a-2271-4ee3-8afc-315fa9cd5778","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"Column numbers are typically zero or positive integers indicating a position in text.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.LocatorLocationAdapter#getColumnNumber():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.806854591Z"}
{"id":"8f4f27ac-34ef-411a-9934-f745613e323a","expr":"result >= -1","rationale":"The getLineNumber method of Locator usually returns a positive integer or -1 when the location is unknown.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.LocatorLocationAdapter#getLineNumber():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.807290502Z"}
{"id":"5579ecd9-02fb-4835-b01d-4890abc85983","expr":"result != 0","rationale":"Line numbers typically start at 1, so 0 is usually invalid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.LocatorLocationAdapter#getLineNumber():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.807290502Z"}
{"id":"9fbb774b-81c2-49e9-9827-440f504f8f41","expr":"result == -1","rationale":"The method implementation always returns -1 regardless of input.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.LocatorLocationAdapter#getCharacterOffset():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.816841944Z"}
{"id":"2643b969-d300-4886-a335-7d304cc416fc","expr":"result <= 0","rationale":"Because the method returns -1, result is always less than or equal to 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.LocatorLocationAdapter#getCharacterOffset():int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.816841944Z"}
{"id":"951d6fd3-615a-414b-866d-9e158c4907b8","expr":"result == null || result.length() >= 0","rationale":"If result is not null, result.length() is defined and non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.LocatorLocationAdapter#getPublicId():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.831895304Z"}
{"id":"51144b57-391b-46ac-865e-38f84bac3b2f","expr":"result == null || !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the system identifier is present, it generally should not be an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.LocatorLocationAdapter#getSystemId():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.850693345Z"}
{"id":"2910f7a0-9beb-42da-b0ab-b0feb3ed73a7","expr":"result == null || result.indexOf(' ') == -1","rationale":"SystemId typically represents a URI or path that should not contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.LocatorLocationAdapter#getSystemId():String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.850693345Z"}
{"id":"9fc6adab-ffa7-49b3-a8a6-45bec8dbc0b3","expr":"ex != null","rationale":"The warning method logically requires a non-null SAXParseException to log.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852252099Z"}
{"id":"70f3a4ab-caa1-4d48-82ae-dba99375f329","expr":"ex != null","rationale":"The SAXParseException parameter must be non-null since it's used as an argument in logger.warn","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852428942Z"}
{"id":"73a563c3-300f-4e1d-b3a2-13ed2a7a52ef","expr":"ex.getMessage() != null","rationale":"The exception message should be present to describe the warning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852252099Z"}
{"id":"a988caf2-214f-4358-8668-8ecceed5ea9f","expr":"ex.getMessage() != null","rationale":"The exception's message typically contains descriptive information about the warning","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852428942Z"}
{"id":"5edd5daa-52b0-49f2-8af2-c7f4d9e75214","expr":"ex.getLineNumber() >= -1","rationale":"Line number should be either valid or -1 if not specified.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852252099Z"}
{"id":"59239788-08f8-4eb9-a33c-fc7fcfa1f2f6","expr":"ex.getLineNumber() >= -1","rationale":"The line number in SAXParseException represents the XML document position and is never less than -1","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852428942Z"}
{"id":"2333bbc6-52ce-4a47-942c-a5442c4ecb29","expr":"ex.getColumnNumber() >= -1","rationale":"Column number should be either valid or -1 if not specified.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852252099Z"}
{"id":"3e9c3a4a-77f8-4634-84e1-9236491a0d90","expr":"ex.getColumnNumber() >= -1","rationale":"The column number in SAXParseException represents the XML document position and is never less than -1","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852428942Z"}
{"id":"07a55c90-a50e-4536-83e2-a9c74086df1e","expr":"ex.getPublicId() == null || !ex.getPublicId().isEmpty()","rationale":"PublicId is either not specified (null) or should not be empty if present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852252099Z"}
{"id":"1699d8ad-2b75-4d70-abe4-293eb96c829b","expr":"ex.getPublicId() != null || ex.getPublicId() == null","rationale":"The public identifier may or may not be present, but calling getPublicId() is safe and possible here","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#warning(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.852428942Z"}
{"id":"a43fefd3-a733-4214-8104-acf124b6279b","expr":"ex != null","rationale":"Since the method immediately throws the passed exception, it must be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#error(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.854591794Z"}
{"id":"a137d37e-a88c-4f74-9f6e-3683a787ab97","expr":"ex != null","rationale":"Since the method throws the exception parameter, the exception parameter must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#fatalError(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.854676443Z"}
{"id":"64e8d812-8895-47e2-9631-f800fe07c3e9","expr":"ex.getMessage() != null","rationale":"Typical SAXParseException instances have a non-null message describing the error","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#error(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.854591794Z"}
{"id":"48c7163e-8b9f-400b-9567-08e020e758e8","expr":"ex.getMessage() != null || ex.getMessage() == null","rationale":"The exception message can be either null or non-null, so this expresses no constraint but shows ability to call method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#fatalError(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.854676443Z"}
{"id":"119ad79c-0f17-4237-bfc9-410aebb5d82a","expr":"ex.getLineNumber() >= -1","rationale":"Line number is at least -1 (if no location info)","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#error(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.854591794Z"}
{"id":"715d7264-f041-4d54-97e8-2682f22a9c7d","expr":"ex.getColumnNumber() >= -1","rationale":"Column number is at least -1 (if no location info)","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#error(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.854591794Z"}
{"id":"2f113628-ce21-4d7f-baf7-9ffc2cf908f5","expr":"ex.getPublicId() != null || ex.getSystemId() != null","rationale":"SAXParseException typically supplies either public or system id","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleSaxErrorHandler#error(SAXParseException):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleSaxErrorHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.854591794Z"}
{"id":"a98a7307-6d66-4486-adab-e9a52a10438b","expr":"transformer != null","rationale":"The transformer parameter is expected to be non-null to avoid NullPointerException in subsequent calls.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.TransformerUtils#enableIndenting(Transformer):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/TransformerUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.858509640Z"}
{"id":"1c49416d-66ce-45d6-a8fc-4c5982b658de","expr":"transformer != null","rationale":"The transformer parameter is asserted to be non-null at method start.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.TransformerUtils#enableIndenting(Transformer,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/TransformerUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.858806058Z"}
