{"id":"04f9198d-8b47-4300-8bd7-b902f9907269","expr":"result == null || line.indexOf(result) >= 0","rationale":"If result is not null, it is obtained as line.substring(index), so it must appear inside line.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#consume(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:35.892495504Z"}
