{"id":"a23bed25-3e3a-463b-94a3-a391ae323391","expr":"localName != null && !localName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The XML attribute localName should be valid (non-null and non-empty) as it identifies the attribute.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.237880566Z"}
