{"id":"8b067e54-08f9-456d-939d-80dbe56d8a1c","expr":"prefix == null || !prefix.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, namespace prefixes are either null or non-empty to represent meaningful namespaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeNamespace(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.240779042Z"}
