{"id":"cbcb359c-0d70-40ae-902d-fa2a29d148b7","expr":"text != null","rationale":"Because 'text' is used as the backing array for creating a String, it cannot be null to avoid a NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.276416185Z"}
{"id":"82e0970c-3e7e-4523-b0e1-5475d1ae6c4e","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The data parameter should not be null because createCData requires a String argument.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.276574052Z"}
{"id":"2d6a301d-290a-4d54-8cb0-98f6b9e0ad3f","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"Java's String constructor requires 'start' index to be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.276416185Z"}
{"id":"5e624a83-c07d-489c-9dec-9aabeb952bb8","expr":"data.indexOf(\"]]>\" ) == -1","rationale":"The content of CData cannot contain the CData end marker sequence because that would break the XML structure.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.276574052Z"}
