{"id":"2e3243e9-9703-4970-a7aa-ddaaa3a10710","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.length() >= 0","rationale":"If prefix is non-null, it is a valid String which has length >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#removeBinding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.557596181Z"}
{"id":"3146e8b5-c79e-41c8-955f-cb7d1dfd5369","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.equals(prefix.trim())","rationale":"Since manipulation involves keys in maps, prefix is expected not to contain leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#removeBinding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.557596181Z"}
{"id":"658a273f-0e88-4683-9f82-28597abb7411","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned Iterator<String> should not be null as it represents iteration over keySet.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#getBoundPrefixes():Iterator<String>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.565926303Z"}
{"id":"c4279cbf-27ac-439e-8927-dee9027769ed","expr":"result.hasNext() == (result != null && result.hasNext())","rationale":"The iterator's hasNext method indicates whether there are more elements to iterate over.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#getBoundPrefixes():Iterator<String>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.565926303Z"}
{"id":"1667aa3f-b6f6-4e41-854e-c4692c4a2daa","expr":"(!result.hasNext() || result.next() != null)","rationale":"Prefixes iterated by the iterator are non-null strings, so next() should not return null if hasNext is true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#getBoundPrefixes():Iterator<String>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.565926303Z"}
{"id":"32947c24-220d-4583-a7ff-1e704c4c5d21","expr":"result.hasNext() || !result.hasNext()","rationale":"A trivial invariant emphasizing that hasNext returns a boolean value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.SimpleNamespaceContext#getBoundPrefixes():Iterator<String>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/SimpleNamespaceContext.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.565926303Z"}
{"id":"03e6ba63-2cbc-4e73-8fc5-447dc7b819b2","expr":"prefix != null","rationale":"prefix is used as a key in a map, so it is likely non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.568696318Z"}
{"id":"cbe4a2d9-4e17-4d1d-ba4a-acb42880fc17","expr":"uri != null","rationale":"uri is used as a value in a map, generally non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.568696318Z"}
{"id":"23805eb4-746d-43e8-b7a2-e4849afdd61f","expr":"!prefix.isEmpty() || prefix.equals(\"\")","rationale":"prefix might be empty string or non-empty but should be valid","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.568696318Z"}
{"id":"98c128c3-a48a-4712-99fe-7ce9b1615bce","expr":"!uri.isEmpty() || uri.equals(\"\")","rationale":"uri might be empty string or non-empty but should be valid","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.568696318Z"}
{"id":"ce75fcc9-670d-4af6-85b4-423bb52aa74b","expr":"prefix != null","rationale":"The prefix is used as a key in a map, so it is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.576128931Z"}
{"id":"4f090611-e101-4212-89ad-c739f2ba596a","expr":"uri != null","rationale":"The uri is used as a value in a map, it is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.576128931Z"}
{"id":"c6387f34-62d4-4535-beaa-f9811604bad8","expr":"qName != null && !qName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The qName parameter is expected to be a valid XML qualified name, therefore non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.576472047Z"}
{"id":"3a316746-e870-4ebf-87f7-f9e17b293f83","expr":"uri != null","rationale":"The uri parameter representing the namespace URI should not be null after method processing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.576472047Z"}
{"id":"bf8a1838-c63c-4419-8313-7bc060e7b4b3","expr":"localName != null && !localName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The localName parameter should be non-null and non-empty as it identifies the element's local name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.576472047Z"}
{"id":"ed6cef1f-199a-40f9-86f4-f31a4d873f9f","expr":"atts != null","rationale":"The atts parameter should be a valid Attributes object, not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.576472047Z"}
{"id":"572f103d-26e5-4576-bbb8-c92ea01ea01a","expr":"atts.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"The atts object represents the attributes of the element and getLength returns the count, which should not be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.576472047Z"}
{"id":"8ae11e6f-6dca-4758-bfec-1d8f6bd78a63","expr":"qName != null","rationale":"startElement is usually called with qName being non-null as it's the qualified XML name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.577314543Z"}
{"id":"8b15e884-1271-443d-a408-62768f3273c0","expr":"(uri == null) || qName.startsWith(uri)","rationale":"If the namespace URI is present, qName often starts with it or incorporates it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.577314543Z"}
{"id":"38e5ab60-08c7-4158-acad-3c41d9b7969f","expr":"localName != null","rationale":"Local name in XML parsing is required and typically non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.577314543Z"}
{"id":"da3e8836-3394-44f1-9d4f-c9e4f323cac3","expr":"atts != null","rationale":"Attributes parameter is likely always non-null to represent attribute list.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.577314543Z"}
{"id":"5e8aa105-ed56-4954-b1e7-726d7db5644f","expr":"atts.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"Attributes length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.577314543Z"}
{"id":"61829214-1542-4ed0-b135-5abeba2deeb1","expr":"!prefix.isEmpty()","rationale":"Namespace prefix usually is not empty in XML context.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.576128931Z"}
{"id":"696281e7-8b40-4f08-810f-25b24aa5c352","expr":"!uri.isEmpty()","rationale":"Namespace uri is usually a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.576128931Z"}
{"id":"86788ac1-499e-43a6-85b0-2f60edb724f5","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.length() >= 0","rationale":"If prefix is not null, its length is at least zero","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.582047764Z"}
{"id":"90e4ac10-2202-44b8-b46c-1d9a51dc97a9","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.trim().length() >= 0","rationale":"If prefix is not null, trimming it results in a string with length at least zero","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.582047764Z"}
{"id":"981c7a4c-60b6-43a0-8e55-cb4c87b12cdc","expr":"uri != null && (qName == null || qName.contains(localName))","rationale":"Qualified name 'qName' typically includes the namespace prefix followed by ':' and then the localName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.582994206Z"}
{"id":"9d9a2765-9ef0-4335-a6d5-1a9a05ae5018","expr":"localName != null && !localName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Because endElement is called on a specific element, localName is expected to be a meaningful non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.582994206Z"}
{"id":"1a984a49-99b6-4c64-9920-77e17eac157b","expr":"(qName == null || !qName.isEmpty())","rationale":"qName should not be an empty string, since it represents the qualified name of element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.582994206Z"}
{"id":"afa7d2d6-509d-4457-9de5-ee2f1503f688","expr":"uri != null || (localName != null && qName != null)","rationale":"This captures that either the namespace URI exists or both localName and qName do, assuming namespace awareness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.582994206Z"}
{"id":"b63a7ea9-9154-4e61-9df4-af7779cda462","expr":"qName == null || qName.startsWith(uri) || !uri.isEmpty()","rationale":"Ensures consistent relationship between uri and qName's prefix (though not guaranteed in all contexts)","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.582994206Z"}
{"id":"2fb836d7-207f-441f-9347-79505c879aab","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The input character array must be non-null because the String constructor called with (char[], int, int) throws NullPointerException if ch is null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.586058435Z"}
{"id":"ec1db2e2-c3cf-41a0-8c10-8ea4c81d1afd","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"The start index must be non-negative as it is used by the String constructor to indicate the starting index in the character array","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.586058435Z"}
{"id":"83e73dd3-d479-4d10-b09b-32f9ff5f1071","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"The length parameter must be non-negative because it is the count of characters to use from the char array to create the string","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.586058435Z"}
{"id":"ebe22f67-0d73-4400-936f-d8a8d5a1d8d9","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The sum of start and length must be <= ch.length for the constructor new String(ch, start, length) to be valid and not raise an IndexOutOfBoundsException","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.586058435Z"}
{"id":"c1eb08b9-5ecb-49c4-b95d-d03fdcda2bef","expr":"length == 0 || start < ch.length","rationale":"If length is positive then start must be less than array length otherwise the substring is invalid","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.586058435Z"}
{"id":"b65c0eda-abfb-4ffa-938b-a84af67a5af6","expr":"uri != null || (localName != null && qName != null)","rationale":"Either uri is provided, or both localName and qName are provided, to identify the element.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.587227807Z"}
{"id":"f3b3eb64-dec6-42b7-98da-9e2aa3037e3b","expr":"(qName == null) || qName.length() > 0","rationale":"If qName is provided, it is not empty, representing a qualified XML name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.587227807Z"}
{"id":"3dfb87a2-622f-4fa5-a373-a02c9ad60c76","expr":"(localName == null) || localName.length() >= 0","rationale":"localName is a string representing the local part of the element name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.587227807Z"}
{"id":"b5d2976c-3ace-43e7-8461-da79139e6425","expr":"uri == null || uri.length() >= 0","rationale":"uri is a namespace URI string, can be null or non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.587227807Z"}
{"id":"778e7307-4e9a-40c7-9669-3652ad4d64f8","expr":"(localName != null || qName != null)","rationale":"To identify the element, either localName or qName should be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.587227807Z"}
{"id":"d8f1933f-2a39-4fab-86dd-2307e3b62300","expr":"ch != null && start >= 0 && length >= 0 && start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"Safe construction of the String from the char array with given start and length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.588286219Z"}
{"id":"ae3d1eef-9f4a-45a7-9082-3ae6e4b8dfd6","expr":"length == 0 || ch.length > 0","rationale":"If 'length' is positive, 'ch' must contain characters to extract from.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.588286219Z"}
{"id":"83302082-cf3e-45fb-81e8-348f92dd9435","expr":"start <= ch.length","rationale":"Ensuring start index is within char array bounds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.588286219Z"}
{"id":"ef4f7210-0005-4bb4-9c6a-efc02bdd142b","expr":"length <= ch.length","rationale":"Logical bound check for length relative to the char array size.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.588286219Z"}
{"id":"4c7a3f76-0e09-40e2-a414-0ca0ecf3e9e3","expr":"start + length >= 0","rationale":"Ensures the parameters to String constructor are non-negative and valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.588286219Z"}
{"id":"5326838a-2e4d-45d6-bd37-e198fc5eec8f","expr":"start >= 0 && length >= 0","rationale":"start and length are used to create a substring from the char array, so both must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.591079568Z"}
{"id":"33ddc48e-812f-4e83-8c04-cfc7179036cb","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The constructor String(ch, start, length) requires ch to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.591079568Z"}
{"id":"16da62aa-6b5a-476c-8271-844dd17d7ad1","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"To safely create new String(ch, start, length), the boundaries must be inside ch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.591079568Z"}
{"id":"d4c81610-8b86-44d1-b676-81dd54bce690","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The processingInstructionInternal method likely requires a non-null target to identify the target of the processing instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.594364673Z"}
{"id":"553092d5-af3e-4bd7-9270-686586be858e","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Since data is passed to processingInstructionInternal, it is plausible that data must be at least a valid string, possibly empty but not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.594364673Z"}
{"id":"b05049b6-baf7-4589-93d0-646d8ee6179e","expr":"target.length() > 0","rationale":"Processing instructions generally have a non-empty target to specify the instruction name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.594364673Z"}
{"id":"66d31bbb-454e-44db-bb88-1e27094d4642","expr":"!target.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"The target string should not contain processing instruction start delimiters which might be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.594364673Z"}
{"id":"a06accf4-49b6-4211-9c39-2dfbdf1ad978","expr":"data.isEmpty() || data != null","rationale":"Since data is a string parameter, it might be empty or non-null when passed to the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.594364673Z"}
{"id":"b119f8d7-7da7-4abd-87be-0ce58a966f77","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The array 'ch' must be non-null to create a new String from it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.587342122Z"}
{"id":"a590a853-eb43-4c9f-9639-6e0a29155683","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"'start' must be zero or positive to be a valid index into the array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.587342122Z"}
{"id":"c6441ee0-102d-4c81-b643-af15686d0552","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"'length' must be zero or positive for the substring length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.587342122Z"}
{"id":"8241fdeb-2c2d-402b-b610-ee5777aaa1cc","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The substring from 'start' to 'start + length' must fit inside 'ch' array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.587342122Z"}
{"id":"ae9b81e4-c754-412f-bffd-b53fa7058cf1","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0","rationale":"The skippedEntity method is only meaningful if name is non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.597301722Z"}
{"id":"3450509e-c685-47d6-81fd-08a016ff7281","expr":"name == null || name.indexOf(' ') == -1","rationale":"XML entity names do not contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.597301722Z"}
{"id":"b19e8eb3-abbb-4335-8526-84fabedff91c","expr":"target != null && data != null || target == null || data == null","rationale":"method is called with target and data; the exceptions thrown indicate that the method likely expects target and data to be passed along","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.597706535Z"}
{"id":"e7a7c419-998d-4d21-9b59-bd290d3bfde6","expr":"target != null && !target.isEmpty() || target == null || target.isEmpty()","rationale":"target is expected to be a non-empty processing instruction target string or possibly empty but still processed","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.597706535Z"}
{"id":"6dd5c6dc-8c6b-4a71-bb53-da30d4883b61","expr":"data != null && data.length() >= 0","rationale":"data is a string and length is non-negative if data is non-null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.597706535Z"}
{"id":"c44c0285-7a5c-4b16-9b56-a185d12d5dc5","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is used unconditionally to build the DOCTYPE string, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.600347336Z"}
{"id":"bd47b25f-3406-4f58-9e6c-05118a7077bc","expr":"systemId != null","rationale":"In the method, systemId is appended without null guards, so it's expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.600347336Z"}
{"id":"d216578b-a131-4ef7-aa99-726a37a5fc82","expr":"(publicId == null) || (publicId.length() > 0)","rationale":"If publicId is provided, it is used meaningfully, so if not null, it is presumably non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.600347336Z"}
{"id":"12b3a306-8b7a-4ba4-a376-2770c1fce53f","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"As 'name' is used in constructing DOCTYPE, it should have a positive length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.600347336Z"}
{"id":"2d791579-c350-4487-a34a-243290371763","expr":"systemId.length() > 0","rationale":"The systemId string is appended directly; presumably it's non-empty for a valid DOCTYPE.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.600347336Z"}
{"id":"01352204-2df2-4776-8a2a-a15442645551","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0","rationale":"Based on the method appending name to the DOCTYPE, name must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.603977010Z"}
{"id":"1fb5b826-108d-41d6-a112-c7e3bc209340","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method uses 'name' in a method call 'skippedEntityInternal(name)', so nullness is relevant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.605084675Z"}
{"id":"3726dcdf-93c9-442b-96ef-d17f191fb16f","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Entity names in XML are usually non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.605084675Z"}
{"id":"20c95ef5-9002-4717-a1d4-145e552821de","expr":"!name.contains(\" \")","rationale":"XML entity names typically are tokens without whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.605084675Z"}
{"id":"c4907d2b-69c6-46ba-9e31-e0536c52aa9e","expr":"(publicId != null) || (systemId != null && systemId.length() > 0)","rationale":"SystemId is appended either after 'PUBLIC' if publicId is present or after 'SYSTEM' otherwise, implying systemId is always non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.603977010Z"}
{"id":"5a4d9af0-c2ae-4879-9b09-fc73cadf6c37","expr":"systemId != null && systemId.length() > 0","rationale":"The method appends systemId in both branches implying systemId must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.603977010Z"}
{"id":"acc2a4e4-d91e-42a6-a74a-d2ca167d4be0","expr":"publicId == null || (publicId.length() > 0)","rationale":"The code appends 'PUBLIC \"' + publicId + '\" \"', so if publicId is not null, it likely is non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.603977010Z"}
{"id":"a3ba3584-2601-47be-a9a4-e4610960a21c","expr":"!(publicId != null && systemId == null)","rationale":"When publicId is non-null, systemId must also be non-null to produce a well-formed DOCTYPE declaration.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.603977010Z"}
{"id":"309d27e8-ab73-4424-b204-a1ec8bc77b69","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"Creating a new String with the given char array requires that the array is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.617419808Z"}
{"id":"9d81fedc-318a-4085-9f1a-8875d38b7809","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"The start index for substring extraction must be within valid array bounds, starting from zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.617419808Z"}
{"id":"bbe1a392-5de3-46ff-a9dd-cfa820efb5b7","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"Length passed to String constructor must be non-negative to avoid exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.617419808Z"}
{"id":"dee673b1-5a6a-4b7a-aa59-4e4e4707d956","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The substring defined by start and length must fit entirely within the bounds of the char array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.617419808Z"}
{"id":"aece783a-d013-48c9-a50a-e2761e367092","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method logically expects 'name' parameter to identify the entity starting.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.619597728Z"}
{"id":"2b82e248-ba9f-4aa8-aa51-127512853532","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Entity names should generally be non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.619597728Z"}
{"id":"5d5a939d-cb1c-4824-ba6d-0c51fa180324","expr":"name.trim().length() == name.length()","rationale":"Leading or trailing spaces in name are generally disallowed or unintended.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.619597728Z"}
{"id":"33295b03-aa87-4e80-b2aa-259333601c26","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter should be non-null after the method starts processing an entity.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.621277992Z"}
{"id":"b6f0f60c-6fcc-45d0-9ec8-af556cf60f27","expr":"ch != null  &&  start >= 0  &&  length >= 0  &&  start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The constructor new String(char[] value, int offset, int count) requires that offset and count specify a valid range within the array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.621719653Z"}
{"id":"a3af305b-8487-42f2-b2a3-b399461c61c3","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"Length describes how many characters from ch starting at start are used. Negative length would be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.621719653Z"}
{"id":"da571029-215e-4d7a-bc6d-a297aea31030","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"Java array indexing requires start index to be at least 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.621719653Z"}
{"id":"6b2bc533-43e0-462d-a477-5a3553caeb48","expr":"start <= ch.length","rationale":"Start index must be within or at most equal to ch length to avoid IndexOutOfBounds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.621719653Z"}
{"id":"5ec1d7cd-e401-4778-a135-6c1334e92fcf","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter represents the entity name to end; it is expected to be non-null to identify the entity.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.625800967Z"}
{"id":"360c74bb-6daf-4ca5-9db8-55c55fe69269","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"An entity name having length greater than zero makes sense semantically for XML entity naming.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.625800967Z"}
{"id":"f023b908-8f56-4dd4-ace6-8a3d44c63284","expr":"!name.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Entity names in XML do not generally contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.625800967Z"}
{"id":"176679b9-4425-45f1-bf82-95beaf8b2311","expr":"name.equals(name.trim())","rationale":"It is expected that entity names are trimmed and do not have excess whitespace around.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.625800967Z"}
{"id":"b8392383-8245-4b56-97e3-1a1bbdff8d9c","expr":"qualifiedName != null","rationale":"The method accesses qualifiedName and calls methods on it, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.628420949Z"}
{"id":"ebf30c2e-a3ae-4f37-a9ed-0eb835f97047","expr":"qualifiedName.indexOf(':') >= -1","rationale":"The indexOf method returns -1 or higher for any string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.628420949Z"}
{"id":"b559b899-1bdf-47ad-9001-78b973ca58ba","expr":"(qualifiedName.indexOf(':') == -1) || (qualifiedName.indexOf(':') < qualifiedName.length() - 1)","rationale":"If ':' exists, the substring after ':' (localPart) should be valid and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.628420949Z"}
{"id":"9821b0ae-1984-4b47-a83d-cacfd42daf3c","expr":"namespaceUri == null || namespaceUri.length() >= 0","rationale":"namespaceUri can be null or any string length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.628420949Z"}
{"id":"e2ae659e-ea90-4d10-8926-af7e988a9c1a","expr":"qualifiedName.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.628420949Z"}
{"id":"d84f2e75-271b-43e7-b700-483247805efe","expr":"qName != null","rationale":"Parameter qName should be non-null to access its methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.629866130Z"}
{"id":"b4414b77-6034-400a-82c2-acd42fa43603","expr":"qName.getPrefix() != null","rationale":"Prefix string should be non-null to allow empty check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.629866130Z"}
{"id":"99e7dbb1-a677-435e-8c5c-38735ef51365","expr":"qName.getLocalPart() != null","rationale":"LocalPart string should be non-null to allow equality check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.629866130Z"}
{"id":"4db78254-3070-49c6-869d-32b79491ea9f","expr":"qName.getLocalPart().length() >= 0","rationale":"Strings returned by getLocalPart have non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.629866130Z"}
{"id":"891819ec-b077-48f3-95d9-3b766080d31c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new QName object constructed from inputs, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.630726781Z"}
{"id":"0ac05236-1bb8-4441-8ddc-4622eb58e2ed","expr":"qualifiedName.indexOf(':') == -1 || result.getLocalPart().equals(qualifiedName.substring(qualifiedName.indexOf(':') + 1))","rationale":"When qualifiedName contains ':', the local part in result is the substring after ':'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.630726781Z"}
{"id":"ee08ea33-de1b-4361-8fb7-31d1d8aceb80","expr":"qualifiedName.indexOf(':') == -1 || result.getPrefix().equals(qualifiedName.substring(0, qualifiedName.indexOf(':')))","rationale":"When qualifiedName contains ':', the prefix in result is the substring before ':'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.630726781Z"}
{"id":"883bb19e-05af-46d0-80ab-125907f07dd5","expr":"result.getNamespaceURI() == namespaceUri","rationale":"The QName is constructed using the given namespaceUri, so result.getNamespaceURI() equals namespaceUri.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.630726781Z"}
{"id":"081e418f-67d7-4ad4-b691-df643348ef6c","expr":"qualifiedName.indexOf(':') == -1 || (!result.getLocalPart().contains(\":\") && !result.getPrefix().contains(\":\"))","rationale":"Local part and prefix are substrings split by ':', so they will not contain ':' themselves.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.630726781Z"}
{"id":"4f6bb394-a70c-4fde-9590-bd4661b3f4e4","expr":"!result || (qName.getPrefix().isEmpty() || !qName.getLocalPart().isEmpty())","rationale":"If the QName is declared as a namespace, then prefix is empty or localPart not empty holds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.635321501Z"}
{"id":"b54513b6-d894-469c-80a3-f722cde63acf","expr":"!result || (qName.getLocalPart() != null && qName.getPrefix() != null)","rationale":"If result is true, both qName fields must be non-null to safely evaluate their equality to \"xmlns\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.635321501Z"}
{"id":"c411e253-6e96-45a3-95f8-fcf30cd1bfee","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a map from the last element of a non-empty list, which is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#currentNamespaceMapping():Map<String, String>","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.638251376Z"}
{"id":"a3648166-9fa9-4c29-8ec2-eef0e39d72c1","expr":"contentHandler == null || contentHandler.getClass().getMethods().length > 0","rationale":"If contentHandler is not null, it should be a real content handler with methods defined (heuristic)","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#setContentHandler(ContentHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.646524572Z"}
{"id":"2cb3033d-4b1b-4cab-99bc-65239a96bae2","expr":"contentHandler == null || contentHandler.getClass() != null","rationale":"If contentHandler is not null, it must have a non-null class object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#setContentHandler(ContentHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.647366547Z"}
{"id":"2d40216c-d690-47a3-8236-f0bf1597ff93","expr":"result == null || result.getClass() != null","rationale":"If result is not null, it must be a valid instance of ContentHandler (which must have a class).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getContentHandler():ContentHandler","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.657518961Z"}
{"id":"52184173-6d85-4416-a1df-3276df2dba51","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method uses name.startsWith(), which requires name to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getFeature(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.663443144Z"}
{"id":"5cda7cc3-7fd1-4233-8cd9-6190062c513a","expr":"result == false","rationale":"The method returns false when the input name starts with 'http://xml.org/sax/features/'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getFeature(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.663727619Z"}
{"id":"995f92b4-46b2-4843-ab14-65a9527ec8d8","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method uses 'name.startsWith', so 'name' must be non-null at the start.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#setFeature(String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:11:36.663955368Z"}
