{"id":"36feb281-a222-41dd-9ec4-7d1e26709918","expr":"classLoader == null || classLoader.getClass() != null","rationale":"classLoader can be nullable, but if not null, it points to a valid ClassLoader instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#resolveClassName(String,ClassLoader):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:19.822767099Z"}
{"id":"f47be60d-c95b-4729-8e7b-f25622f7d423","expr":"className.indexOf(' ') < 0","rationale":"A valid class name does not contain spaces; this invariant captures that property.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#resolveClassName(String,ClassLoader):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:19.822767099Z"}
{"id":"378638fb-3087-40e6-858d-8aa2a7f285fb","expr":"className.startsWith(\"[\") == (className.endsWith(\"]\"))","rationale":"If className represents an array type, it is expected to start with '[' and end with ']' according to naming conventions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#resolveClassName(String,ClassLoader):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:19.822767099Z"}
{"id":"fa1912a9-f734-44f0-9a96-eb0b03daedfa","expr":"classLoader == null || classLoader.getParent() != classLoader","rationale":"Usually, the classLoader's parent is not the same instance as the classLoader itself, reflecting a parent delegation model.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#resolveClassName(String,ClassLoader):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:19.822767099Z"}
{"id":"eeb7e7a5-8cd1-4588-8c25-c2bbb077db97","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method starts by asserting that 'type' is not null, so this must hold at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isAssignableValue(Class<?>,Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:19.870102017Z"}
