{"id":"268c7659-9bf5-4ae9-9bb6-ab941c32635e","expr":"value != null || !type.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Ensures that null is only assignable to non-primitive types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isAssignableValue(Class<?>,Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:19.870102017Z"}
{"id":"9639e05b-3042-4b16-9665-d9487ddaf308","expr":"(value == null && result) == (value == null && !type.isPrimitive())","rationale":"If value is null, the method returns true only if the type is not primitive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isAssignableValue(Class<?>,Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:19.908860821Z"}
{"id":"1142ba6f-4687-4f00-9f01-6dd97554c4e2","expr":"!result || (value != null && type.isAssignableFrom(value.getClass())) || (value == null && !type.isPrimitive())","rationale":"If result is true, then either value is not null and the type is assignable from value's class, or value is null and the type is not primitive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isAssignableValue(Class<?>,Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:19.908860821Z"}
