{"id":"f64b26a7-a976-49bc-8977-b380ef2fb593","expr":"(classes == null) == (result == \"[]\")","rationale":"The method likely converts the array of Classes to a list and then to a string, representing null input as empty brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classNamesToString(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:24.797676499Z"}
{"id":"cd7a2dd5-e83a-4f1e-988d-15e81062ed77","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned string always represents the classes list, which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classNamesToString(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:24.797676499Z"}
{"id":"ebff0ac8-5113-4414-8f4e-59196e21d4d5","expr":"result.startsWith(\"[\") && result.endsWith(\"]\")","rationale":"The string representation of the classes list includes square brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classNamesToString(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:24.797676499Z"}
{"id":"35bf0c63-4af7-4cc4-a9fe-332c8a939cf7","expr":"classes == null || result.length() >= 2","rationale":"The string returned for a null input is \"[]\", so length is at least 2; otherwise, the output includes more content.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classNamesToString(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:24.797676499Z"}
{"id":"f8e67033-d2c2-464c-a10a-c86dd93e26c9","expr":"classes == null || (result.contains(classes[0].getName()) || classes.length == 0)","rationale":"The string generated includes class names of input classes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classNamesToString(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:24.797676499Z"}
{"id":"ab7e08ad-cf06-44e8-a098-c08489fe2aa9","expr":"classes == null || !classes.isEmpty() || classes.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method checks if classes is null or empty, the code implicitly handles such cases.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classNamesToString(Collection<Class<?>>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:24.839972171Z"}
