{"id":"f2e360c4-6370-435a-8f7a-10631de056b7","expr":"result == null || (result.isAssignableFrom(clazz1) && result.isAssignableFrom(clazz2))","rationale":"The method returns a class that is the common ancestor of clazz1 and clazz2, so the result must be assignable from both.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.419616543Z"}
