{"id":"db4947c8-1095-4531-94d6-0fb37cc0205d","expr":"result == null || (result != clazz1 || !clazz2.isAssignableFrom(clazz1))","rationale":"The method returns clazz1 if clazz1 is assignable from clazz2, so if result equals clazz1, this must hold.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.419616543Z"}
{"id":"88a7de7f-8e97-4adc-a096-cfad9ada8884","expr":"result == null || (result != clazz2 || !clazz1.isAssignableFrom(clazz2))","rationale":"Similarly, the method returns clazz2 if clazz2 is assignable from clazz1, so if result equals clazz2, this must hold.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.419616543Z"}
{"id":"ae575122-dafb-471c-9a9d-4543cac77a8b","expr":"result != null || (clazz1 != null && clazz2 != null && !clazz1.isAssignableFrom(clazz2) && !clazz2.isAssignableFrom(clazz1))","rationale":"The method returns null only when both classes exist and no class is assignable from the other or common ancestor (except Object).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.419616543Z"}
{"id":"ae2dd08b-9407-4328-a574-b265d24b6a10","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"If clazz is non-null, getInterfaces() should return a non-null array (possibly zero length) of interfaces directly implemented by clazz.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.439644406Z"}
{"id":"52ce5d19-0c83-4aa3-87a8-8f59ec3fc8fd","expr":"clazz == null || !clazz.isPrimitive() || clazz.getSuperclass() == null","rationale":"If clazz represents a primitive type, its superclass must be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.439644406Z"}
{"id":"e555d750-e413-42cb-b87e-eb911c055370","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getPackage() != null || clazz.isPrimitive() || clazz.isArray()","rationale":"If clazz is not null and not primitive or array, it should have a non-null package.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.439644406Z"}
{"id":"7b4ccd5a-6017-48ee-ae3f-0bb0101ca089","expr":"clazz == null || !clazz.isArray() || clazz.getComponentType() != null","rationale":"If clazz is an array type, the component type must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.439644406Z"}
{"id":"7f993afd-2191-4bc7-948a-29f82528689f","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method calls clazz.getModifiers(), which requires clazz to be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isStaticClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.505666925Z"}
{"id":"2b06ce22-fb89-4c3d-8455-17a998af9cb3","expr":"clazz.getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Modifiers are bit flags represented as non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isStaticClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.505666925Z"}
{"id":"136ba718-2e70-4cdb-954c-5b5266849222","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts that clazz must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.608333536Z"}
{"id":"c843d0d3-2b5c-4d39-a7d8-dfdee185bfe6","expr":"!clazz.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Generally, this method processes classes and interfaces, primitive types don't have interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.608333536Z"}
{"id":"55b25669-29a4-45b1-9157-2bdb8c4b2cf5","expr":"classLoader == null || clazz.getClassLoader() == classLoader || clazz.getClassLoader() == null","rationale":"Class may have the same or no class loader as the given one or the parameter can be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:34.608333536Z"}
{"id":"c3b7a741-1aa6-4829-b53e-a153bf3d053b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an array of Class, never null according to typical contract.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.325459945Z"}
{"id":"c4e07cd0-0bcf-48c1-bf28-812b8dd170d7","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"null check for safe method calls","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isLambdaClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.374708506Z"}
{"id":"edbba0c3-9fe3-4ad6-8581-07e2e0fb7a86","expr":"clazz.isSynthetic() == false || clazz.getInterfaces().length > 0","rationale":"If synthetic, must implement interfaces","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isLambdaClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.374708506Z"}
{"id":"658d2f5f-8d54-4cca-b890-c02f606baad6","expr":"clazz.getInterfaces().length >= 0","rationale":"Interfaces length is non-negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isLambdaClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.374708506Z"}
{"id":"7ca9feac-deb2-4777-bb64-156d78f0cd4d","expr":"!result || clazz.isSynthetic()","rationale":"The method's condition requires clazz.isSynthetic() to be true for result == true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isLambdaClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.414255303Z"}
{"id":"5f907c82-0df5-45fb-b097-810f933f3418","expr":"!result || clazz.getInterfaces().length > 0","rationale":"The method checks that the interfaces array length is positive when result is true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isLambdaClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.414255303Z"}
{"id":"678b2886-7bae-4916-b70e-33e1e69788c2","expr":"object != null","rationale":"The method calls object.getClass(), so object must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxy(Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.450846968Z"}
{"id":"fe5863dc-5967-4991-bf3f-7f8af54cd61e","expr":"object.getClass() != null","rationale":"Any non-null object always has a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxy(Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.450846968Z"}
{"id":"0dda562a-48d1-4adc-b125-170318568ff4","expr":"!result || object.getClass() != null","rationale":"Since result depends on object's class being a cglib proxy class, object's class must be non-null when result is true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxy(Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.487354283Z"}
{"id":"5ae3701e-1248-4022-af22-de9c1e3da6dc","expr":"!result || object.getClass().getName().contains(\"$$\")","rationale":"Cglib proxy classes typically have $$ in their names, so if result is true, object's class name likely contains $$.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxy(Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.487354283Z"}
{"id":"3690149f-5f68-4248-89a2-ddc215f3f2c3","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"If clazz is not null, getName() must return a non-null String since Class names are always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.522305640Z"}
{"id":"6b8c77b7-b083-4fb0-9a44-5925f84c64f8","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.isArray() == false","rationale":"At method entry, clazz either is null or not an array, as proxy classes are not array classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.522305640Z"}
{"id":"47527c22-cb1e-4b2e-9c8c-0fcb97459745","expr":"!result || clazz != null","rationale":"If result is true, then clazz must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.557641510Z"}
{"id":"753f0bcc-81cf-4ef8-bfa2-aedb7b49ec42","expr":"clazz == null || !result || clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Ensuring it is safe to call getName if clazz is not null and method returns true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.557641510Z"}
{"id":"d91955c8-2773-4c2f-bd82-ffef48dc3073","expr":"className == null || className.contains(\"$$\")","rationale":"If className is not null, it may contain the CGLIB class separator indicating a Cglib proxy class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.593232420Z"}
{"id":"9da07d4b-d162-4a96-9c88-429476a8cf03","expr":"className == null || className.length() >= 2","rationale":"If className is not null and contains the separator, it must have some length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.593232420Z"}
{"id":"7d0c091c-66de-49b7-ae0f-f9717dde0213","expr":"className == null || !className.isEmpty()","rationale":"If className is not null, it logically should not be empty as that cannot contain the separator.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.593232420Z"}
{"id":"a54dabeb-4ea6-40ad-8ba0-40f77eeee842","expr":"className != null || !className.contains(\"$$\")","rationale":"If className is null, it does not contain the CGLIB class separator.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.593232420Z"}
{"id":"e7fc5f10-912c-41de-883a-39867a6ab846","expr":"result == (className != null && className.contains(\"$$\"))","rationale":"The method returns true only if className is not null and contains the CGLIB_CLASS_SEPARATOR \"$$\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.628547361Z"}
{"id":"e4f496c6-144d-4ebb-84b5-c9bbb68effab","expr":"!result || (className != null && className.contains(\"$$\"))","rationale":"If result is true, className must be non-null and contain the CGLIB separator.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.628547361Z"}
{"id":"cab532d7-a913-421f-91b0-984e0f6220cf","expr":"result == false || className != null","rationale":"If the method returns true, then className cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.628547361Z"}
{"id":"21f63e9c-b2be-4e26-9d31-92bfda6c8bf5","expr":"!result || className.contains(\"$$\")","rationale":"If result is true, className must contain the CGLIB separator.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.628547361Z"}
{"id":"7280dfa7-fc3f-499c-a4b6-d899fb4662c1","expr":"className != null || !result","rationale":"If className is null, the result must be false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.628547361Z"}
{"id":"e1815f06-760f-4cd8-9f45-38a31fd2a58d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method is expected to always return a non-null set to represent interfaces, even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.809122356Z"}
{"id":"96b295b3-84f6-4029-81ff-e7c27213849f","expr":"!result.contains(null)","rationale":"Since the method returns interfaces implemented by the class, null interfaces would be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.809122356Z"}
{"id":"453ba6c1-9f95-4eac-a7dc-3ed17740bca7","expr":"!result.contains(clazz)","rationale":"The method returns all interfaces for the class; the class itself should not be included.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:35.809122356Z"}
{"id":"f344cffa-f091-4835-92b9-601bbe405767","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet expects a Class object and typically operates with a non-null argument.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.603925523Z"}
{"id":"80fd6a7f-2186-4706-a19a-fef185c77be5","expr":"!clazz.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Fetching interfaces for a primitive class (like int.class) doesn't make sense; so if clazz is primitive, interfaces set is empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.603925523Z"}
{"id":"17f4da53-9b4d-469d-94df-c406c2297abb","expr":"(!clazz.isArray() || clazz.getComponentType() != null)","rationale":"This invariant ensures that if clazz represents an array, its component type must be non-null, which is always the case.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.603925523Z"}
{"id":"fc4e99bc-193f-4ac0-8d56-d60ec5f7c777","expr":"!clazz.getName().endsWith(\"$\")","rationale":"This invariant filters out classes that end with '$', possibly capturing a characteristic of input classes this method expects.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.603925523Z"}
{"id":"9a809e0a-ca18-4e49-a51f-dd7c42afb7cd","expr":"clazz.getPackage() == null || clazz.getPackage().getName() != null","rationale":"This invariant captures that clazz either doesn't belong to a package or that the package name is defined.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.603925523Z"}
{"id":"ffd1d6a1-0505-4337-bd26-e3a447a5e390","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method getUserClass requires a non-null Class object to evaluate its name and superclass.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.664540932Z"}
{"id":"166741cf-1e6d-4b36-bfc7-9cf2bd4cc9a4","expr":"!clazz.getName().contains(\"$$\") || clazz.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"If the class name indicates a CGLIB proxy, then its superclass is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.664540932Z"}
{"id":"2c232f74-5a7e-4939-938e-6b6bc750e134","expr":"clazz.getSuperclass() != clazz","rationale":"A class’s superclass cannot be itself.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.664540932Z"}
{"id":"0776f28a-f862-45e8-ab46-ad67b5bb848e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns either the superclass or clazz itself, both of which are expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.710298912Z"}
{"id":"5953dcea-58dc-4f9f-bacd-5fc82febd7e2","expr":"result == clazz || (clazz.getName().contains(\"$$\") && result == clazz.getSuperclass())","rationale":"If the class name contains the CGLIB proxy separator, the result is the superclass; otherwise, the result is clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.710298912Z"}
{"id":"fb0d6a04-af6f-4467-a9cd-20d3c601a28e","expr":"result.getName().equals(clazz.getName()) || result == clazz.getSuperclass()","rationale":"Result either has the same name as clazz or is its superclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.710298912Z"}
{"id":"09bb4361-7c90-4783-be8f-82d769384cde","expr":"result == clazz || clazz.getSuperclass() == result","rationale":"Reflects that the method returns clazz or its superclass if criteria met.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.710298912Z"}
{"id":"5ce0a3cd-46ba-4182-858e-54753212b69a","expr":"value == null || value.getClass() != null","rationale":"If value is not null then getClass() must return a valid Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.749483919Z"}
{"id":"35b2274f-9f6d-4ccf-bb56-7877fe06e8ce","expr":"value == null || value.getClass().getTypeName() != null","rationale":"The type name of the class should not be null if value is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.749483919Z"}
{"id":"806168d5-a1ac-47d8-9aac-3737ab372e29","expr":"value == null || value.getClass().getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"The Class.getInterfaces() should return a non-null array even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.749483919Z"}
{"id":"eafbb319-2707-4a02-9d28-bd9e5206ac64","expr":"(value == null && result == null) || (value != null && result != null)","rationale":"The method returns null only if the input value is null. Otherwise, the result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.784493053Z"}
{"id":"83f58b39-f8b7-4e9a-8270-2de8195340e6","expr":"value == null || result.length() >= value.getClass().getTypeName().length()","rationale":"The descriptive type string includes at least the class type name, so the length of the result is at least the length of the class's type name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.784493053Z"}
{"id":"0202cde7-757c-49af-83e8-2446b41d39f2","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Accessing clazz.getTypeName() and clazz.getSimpleName() requires clazz to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#matchesTypeName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:36.817398278Z"}
