{"id":"9c805fbc-8b51-4c13-b9ac-d83958f0ec44","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Invocation of clazz.isMemberClass() requires clazz to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isInnerClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.098803024Z"}
{"id":"722a780e-1f87-4cb5-80df-23a178cb36e0","expr":"!clazz.isAnonymousClass()","rationale":"Inner classes are member classes that are not static; anonymous classes are not inner classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isInnerClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.098803024Z"}
{"id":"1249c6ec-6065-4578-a1cc-972110cd45a9","expr":"clazz.getEnclosingClass() != null || !clazz.isMemberClass()","rationale":"If a class is a member class, it typically has an enclosing class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isInnerClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.098803024Z"}
{"id":"412e4101-df1d-48d7-b6e3-e6eeedf7f0a8","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"Primitive types cannot be inner classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isInnerClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.098803024Z"}
{"id":"bc9e6e98-9df0-4d87-8e6c-27866eb7e728","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null Class object to operate on.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.162010623Z"}
{"id":"cc18d037-1fa6-4792-8f59-9c8a4af9cda8","expr":"clazz.isArray() == false","rationale":"Short name extraction generally applies to non-array classes, or arrays would have a different representation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.162010623Z"}
{"id":"94b21c2c-e43c-49ee-a994-33ffc3ed73e2","expr":"clazz.getName().endsWith('.' + clazz.getSimpleName())","rationale":"The simple name is the suffix of the full class name separated by '.'","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.162010623Z"}
{"id":"3c8cff64-ebee-4556-a644-bd1bf048def0","expr":"clazz.getEnclosingClass() == null || clazz.getSimpleName().length() > 0","rationale":"If a class is nested (has enclosing class), its simple name is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.162010623Z"}
{"id":"aa16af38-fff5-4008-9642-4b55b09c4f86","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Even if the class name is empty, the short name string is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.204968933Z"}
{"id":"cb9f08da-2fe7-4e60-bb7f-fc277d8a236f","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"Class short name cannot be empty string because of Java naming conventions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.204968933Z"}
{"id":"326fc9a8-a606-4b47-9e69-100d043779d4","expr":"!(result.contains(\".\"))","rationale":"The short name of a class does not include package information, so it does not include dots.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.204968933Z"}
{"id":"e07bb202-a5d4-4760-95d4-1cb89d1aa6da","expr":"clazz.getSimpleName().equals(result)","rationale":"Get short name returns the simple name of clazz, so it's equal to clazz.getSimpleName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.204968933Z"}
{"id":"c08f3dfd-3959-49e7-8b24-41e8d795af40","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The clazz parameter must be non-null to derive a short name from it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.241449338Z"}
{"id":"938386d5-4ee6-45ee-ba52-d8bbb081ed6b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method ultimately returns a processed string from getShortName(clazz) and StringUtils.uncapitalizeAsProperty, so result is expected to be a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.304932826Z"}
{"id":"fc5f9b07-ea8e-4114-878f-64961d032e2a","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"Since the method extracts a short class name substring and then uncapitalizes it as a property, the result should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.304932826Z"}
{"id":"16dd98bb-7a00-48c4-adf4-5859aaddd857","expr":"result.indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"The result is derived by extracting substring after the last package separator ('.'), so it should not contain the package separator character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.304932826Z"}
{"id":"564e0c45-2adf-424e-9789-f66a01d50dc8","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The code calls Assert.notNull(clazz), so clazz must not be null here.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.346654157Z"}
{"id":"36d1b9bc-20e1-465f-b989-b5b662183760","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Class.getName() returns a non-null fully qualified name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.346654157Z"}
{"id":"c833e7fe-6f4a-4285-888c-067e66c6c8c4","expr":"clazz.getName().indexOf('.') >= -1","rationale":"The last dot index may be -1 if there's no package.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.346654157Z"}
{"id":"734004ac-c745-4c4b-803d-c197628e01dc","expr":"clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Class names are non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.346654157Z"}
{"id":"db3c452f-88b7-44fd-8388-01acbb5dee0e","expr":"clazz.isArray() == false || clazz.getName().startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"If clazz represents an array, its name starts with '['.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.346654157Z"}
{"id":"dfbed376-bab3-4f19-82dd-2184c4553604","expr":"result.endsWith(\".class\")","rationale":"The method appends CLASS_FILE_SUFFIX ('.class') to the substring to form the result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.382823596Z"}
{"id":"50e54450-a9bb-41e3-9a00-27a395d1b588","expr":"result.length() > 6","rationale":"Since result is substring plus \".class\", it must be longer than just the suffix length 6.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.382823596Z"}
{"id":"a7905fde-059d-4044-8161-7510c6f8e2e0","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getSimpleName() + \".class\")","rationale":"The last part of the class name matches clazz.getSimpleName(), so result equals simple name + \".class\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.382823596Z"}
{"id":"a0ac9e6d-f846-4ab5-8370-ace9eb9d66b0","expr":"result.charAt(0) == clazz.getSimpleName().charAt(0)","rationale":"The result is derived from the simple name of clazz, so initial characters match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:40.382823596Z"}
{"id":"bace1df8-3a58-4814-910d-6162a0101e83","expr":"!clazz.isInterface() || result.size() == 1","rationale":"If clazz is an interface and visible per method logic, the result is Collections.singleton(clazz), size 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:41.984134675Z"}
{"id":"3a11b9e5-9f16-4c75-8b5a-dd7ad1d5e36f","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If clazz is interface and visible, result is singleton; otherwise it collects interfaces from class hierarchy. Result is empty if no visible interfaces found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:41.984134675Z"}
{"id":"e5cfc4f7-c576-47b5-b95e-ce6fae8074f1","expr":"ifc != null","rationale":"The method invokes contains(ifc), which requires ifc non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isJavaLanguageInterface(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:42.965786387Z"}
{"id":"77b3a0e7-d0d5-4a89-8e0a-9ed0bba84dec","expr":"ifc.isInterface()","rationale":"'javaLanguageInterfaces' probably contains only interface Class objects; thus, ifc should be an interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isJavaLanguageInterface(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:42.965786387Z"}
{"id":"3ae1f166-15c4-4a50-8553-4621dba6a603","expr":"ifc.getEnclosingClass() == null","rationale":"If 'ifc' belongs to the core Java language interfaces set, it's probably a top-level interface with no enclosing class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isJavaLanguageInterface(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:42.965786387Z"}
{"id":"abb5ac46-4128-4a46-997d-3c756c8db69c","expr":"ifc.getPackage() != null","rationale":"Interfaces in Java language interfaces set must have a package reference.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isJavaLanguageInterface(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:42.965786387Z"}
{"id":"a0799722-d3ed-4d65-8560-155e81a275ac","expr":"fqClassName != null","rationale":"Method asserts fqClassName must not be null, so this holds before method execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.028494416Z"}
{"id":"ef380c14-1459-412b-b94f-1be51ba75c9b","expr":"fqClassName.contains(\".\") || fqClassName.indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"To compute package name, we rely on position of '.', so invariant reflects its presence or absence.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.028494416Z"}
{"id":"60171d44-3d37-489e-afe2-723aaea9d241","expr":"fqClassName.lastIndexOf('.') <= fqClassName.length() - 1","rationale":"Ensures lastIndexOf('.') result is within valid string index range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.028494416Z"}
{"id":"7f44bc17-aaef-4179-abf2-2ca1e8ef2116","expr":"fqClassName.length() > 0","rationale":"The fqClassName should not be empty string for package extraction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.028494416Z"}
{"id":"4b498aa9-bbb1-4123-b760-8c63391ee498","expr":"(!fqClassName.contains(\".\") || fqClassName.indexOf('.') >= 0)","rationale":"This combined condition holds for any string about '.' presence.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.028494416Z"}
{"id":"1d4ed84a-a2c1-4cf4-9c54-e47589a66a3b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an empty string if no package is found, thus result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.077852833Z"}
{"id":"afc16a09-d96d-4b6e-b452-3f1000d1da67","expr":"result.isEmpty() || fqClassName.startsWith(result + \".\")","rationale":"When there is a package, result is the substring up to the last dot, so fqClassName should start with package plus dot.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.077852833Z"}
{"id":"4fe0a4ed-9316-4d86-908e-7cadd3a71ec0","expr":"result.equals(\"\") || result.indexOf('.') >= 0","rationale":"If there is a package name, it must contain at least one dot, since it is extracted as substring before last dot.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.077852833Z"}
{"id":"7b4062c7-de36-4e3f-84c6-4e793334f52e","expr":"result.length() < fqClassName.length()","rationale":"If package is non-empty, it is a prefix, so shorter; if empty, length is 0 which is less than class name length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.077852833Z"}
{"id":"f03c1f34-afa4-4bd7-98da-b145b290c2bd","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || fqClassName.indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"If result is empty, no dot was found in fqClassName, otherwise lastIndexOf('.') would be >=0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.077852833Z"}
{"id":"ded6814c-1625-4512-a809-1a7aa301e29c","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts that clazz is not null at the entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.118189989Z"}
{"id":"82a17f93-8ef5-4c25-b2b8-51b53c687caa","expr":"clazz.getCanonicalName() == null || clazz.getCanonicalName().equals(clazz.getName())","rationale":"The canonical name, if non-null, should be a standardized version relating to the class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.118189989Z"}
{"id":"0d7788ae-0622-47ea-b65f-ea6963009ea5","expr":"clazz.getCanonicalName() == null || clazz.getCanonicalName().contains(\".\")","rationale":"Canonical names for classes are fully qualified and generally contain package delimiters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.118189989Z"}
{"id":"f4da55b2-65c2-4d0f-8b6e-a99faa2f85bf","expr":"clazz.getTypeName() != null","rationale":"getTypeName() should return a non-null type name for any class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.118189989Z"}
{"id":"14fb3b0b-8e04-455e-a59b-f25f8a0ce2d2","expr":"(!(clazz.getCanonicalName() == null) || (clazz.getTypeName() != null))","rationale":"Either the canonical name is present or the type name is non-null, so a name is always available.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.118189989Z"}
{"id":"7d63e856-62aa-4077-bda1-b2dbb32cd4ea","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns either the canonical name or the type name, both guaranteed non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.155410727Z"}
{"id":"863576b6-4d04-4e8a-9b2e-d6d356571e87","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getCanonicalName()) || result.equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"Based on the implementation, result is equal to canonicalName if not null; otherwise typeName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.155410727Z"}
{"id":"e47f4493-42ca-4587-8f3b-7579e44e3566","expr":"(clazz.getCanonicalName() != null) == result.equals(clazz.getCanonicalName())","rationale":"If canonicalName is non-null, result equals it; else result equals typeName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.155410727Z"}
{"id":"be6478e1-01e1-46fe-9fe1-e8cbe786f1b8","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"Both canonicalName and typeName representations are non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.155410727Z"}
{"id":"e189e1bb-37e9-49c1-b13b-80ec3ebea3b8","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method requires clazz to be non-null, hence this invariant ensures the input parameter is valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.191845977Z"}
{"id":"d516e406-c1b5-4c7a-8b14-4405bacb717a","expr":"clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"The class name must be a valid non-empty string since the Class object must represent a valid class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.191845977Z"}
{"id":"487838fd-63c4-449d-ac95-ea903c4cea3b","expr":"clazz.getTypeName().equals(clazz.getName())","rationale":"In Java, getTypeName() and getName() typically return the fully qualified name of the class including package.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.191845977Z"}
{"id":"dfe544b0-d048-4c63-9f75-9fa5fb6322e8","expr":"!clazz.isPrimitive() || clazz.getTypeName().length() > 0","rationale":"Primitives have type names like int, boolean, which are non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.191845977Z"}
{"id":"c74a8da5-3570-49b4-bc27-1021cc27daa1","expr":"clazz.isArray() == clazz.getTypeName().startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"The class is an array if and only if its type name starts with '['.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.191845977Z"}
{"id":"b71610c9-b79b-4c55-a978-40f1d19e70d1","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"The method returns clazz.getTypeName(), so result should be equal to that.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.226610041Z"}
{"id":"19dccdb4-eacb-4387-b2cb-2d3b61d8401a","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must be non-null for getQualifiedMethodName to operate.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.261210847Z"}
{"id":"24c1a4ff-2bf7-4f81-a07f-ba8e8ef99803","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"A Method instance always has a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.261210847Z"}
{"id":"f0514183-a7b5-4e58-be7e-480e57a0cdc8","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"Every Method is declared by some class, so the declaring class is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.261210847Z"}
{"id":"efb01bb0-fff4-4f38-90c5-749531a8a471","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The declaring class of the method is always assignable from itself.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.261210847Z"}
{"id":"6198667f-2d76-4b7f-913a-e2941ca2c4e1","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a non-null qualified name string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.302532155Z"}
{"id":"d576026e-aebf-4373-ace3-8660a535c854","expr":"result.contains(method.getName())","rationale":"The qualified name must include the method name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.302532155Z"}
{"id":"012070e1-1f41-4c48-ba27-a70240c63564","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"A qualified method name cannot be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.302532155Z"}
{"id":"ab8d5655-92d8-4273-8ff8-9375a2b59dbe","expr":"result.startsWith(method.getDeclaringClass().getName())","rationale":"A qualified method name includes the declaring class name as a prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.302532155Z"}
{"id":"32d7199c-7bf2-489b-8e9e-8323bfc875f2","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is asserted non-null at the beginning.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.338787476Z"}
{"id":"91aa8705-c5f2-486a-9a8d-b1808b9de64d","expr":"(clazz == null) || clazz.isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"If clazz is not null, then it's a class context possibly related to method's declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.338787476Z"}
{"id":"7a3c32b2-6b79-42e9-8b28-cccac1c6ff40","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method name is always non-null as per Java Reflection API.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.338787476Z"}
{"id":"c3284c5a-4637-49de-bc87-c7900f3f224b","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"Every method has a declaring class (Java reflection guarantees this).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.338787476Z"}
{"id":"20db4aec-6b61-4313-8352-b42b2c2b2c67","expr":"((clazz != null) ? clazz : method.getDeclaringClass()).getName() != null","rationale":"The class name used in the returned string is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.338787476Z"}
{"id":"00788856-6973-480c-8d2a-b29f830a237a","expr":"result.startsWith((clazz != null ? clazz : method.getDeclaringClass()).getName())","rationale":"The returned qualified method name always starts with the class name corresponding to clazz if not null, else method.getDeclaringClass()","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.375039391Z"}
{"id":"b3f1bcd6-0e01-41de-bff8-9883f749a0ae","expr":"result.endsWith(method.getName())","rationale":"The qualified method name always ends with the simple name of the method","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.375039391Z"}
{"id":"97c30dee-bd8b-462a-b85c-c98209ea6581","expr":"result.contains(\".\")","rationale":"The returned string concatenates class name, a dot, and method name, so it must have a dot","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.375039391Z"}
{"id":"8c4c021f-6929-4b01-830e-a682d4424490","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"A non-null class is required to determine if it has a constructor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.412392328Z"}
{"id":"4ea3796c-e9ec-4ee0-942e-0b310205919c","expr":"paramTypes != null","rationale":"Non-nullity of paramTypes ensures the method can safely check constructors with given parameter signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.412392328Z"}
{"id":"131516c4-b4d8-4d92-87f5-445e044d3f22","expr":"paramTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"Ensures paramTypes can be treated as the varargs Class parameter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.412392328Z"}
{"id":"33de61a5-583f-4cac-af42-c4a41841e5c8","expr":"clazz.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Indicates that clazz is not an interface, relevant as interfaces do not have constructors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.412392328Z"}
{"id":"23478e14-ea4a-419a-944d-b6811b208e6d","expr":"clazz.getClassLoader() != null","rationale":"Having a class loader is typical for classes that can have constructors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.412392328Z"}
{"id":"755f6d9f-d690-4fb7-9a7c-afa3f53e6848","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method ultimately returns a Class<?> object derived from instance.getClass(), which cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.418289079Z"}
{"id":"680ed090-63c7-4286-b454-50219040d26d","expr":"result.isInstance(instance)","rationale":"The returned Class<?> represents the user class of the instance, so the instance should be an instance of the result class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.418289079Z"}
{"id":"a69069d1-31f5-4cd3-97f3-c12b3e8b3d43","expr":"result.isAssignableFrom(instance.getClass())","rationale":"The returned class is derived from instance.getClass(), so result should be assignable from it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.418289079Z"}
{"id":"ab64dd38-7f92-4b9b-98dd-39dcfa915b3e","expr":"result.getName().equals(instance.getClass().getName())","rationale":"Since the method calls getUserClass(instance.getClass()), the result class represents the user class related to instance's actual class, likely resulting in the same name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.418289079Z"}
{"id":"d2a72951-b049-4d05-b704-58fd9d977f15","expr":"clazz != null && paramTypes != null || !result","rationale":"The method returns true only if a constructor with the given parameter types is available, which requires clazz and paramTypes not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.450503413Z"}
{"id":"e751a0d4-90f8-4c49-a6a4-f514bcc535a8","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts that 'clazz' is not null at the start.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.481257127Z"}
{"id":"29369076-e5c2-4aa5-ab9b-717faf694f47","expr":"paramTypes != null","rationale":"The varargs array 'paramTypes' is never null when called in Java varargs context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.481257127Z"}
{"id":"d030cbe4-2407-48ca-981a-112fb0f7849b","expr":"paramTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"The paramTypes parameter is declared as an array of Class objects.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.481257127Z"}
{"id":"6de07e9d-f573-4b78-9d20-c1e1713fd8b3","expr":"result == null || result.getParameterCount() == paramTypes.length","rationale":"If a constructor is found, its parameter count must match the provided parameter types length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.488772755Z"}
{"id":"f6d1398c-c38b-4ac8-97b5-ba5bd47eb072","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"The constructor (if present) is declared in the class or a superclass of clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.488772755Z"}
{"id":"1335656d-5c0e-41ec-bbfb-6588f43a5668","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass() == clazz","rationale":"Constructors returned correspond exactly to the 'clazz' class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.488772755Z"}
{"id":"9ca2dab9-3c4b-4c6c-8199-c619d2c7e66f","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts clazz must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.526932261Z"}
{"id":"f7a7a96d-f3e6-4219-a606-997e0602188c","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method asserts method must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.526932261Z"}
{"id":"ef847b17-2d04-43cd-9714-c0478775c642","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"A Method object always has a non-null declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.526932261Z"}
{"id":"9bfbb3d5-a519-4d95-b3cf-e68158d66afb","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method name is always non-null in Java reflection.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.526932261Z"}
{"id":"56577d29-0410-4bb1-aea0-cfedc3850112","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"getParameterTypes returns a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.526932261Z"}
{"id":"0200fe51-37a0-444f-ba6e-227c91807b5e","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Methods can only be searched if the clazz parameter is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.564049955Z"}
{"id":"f456dd14-a9cb-4b89-a64d-3ba2f0fe140a","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"A method must have a non-null methodName for meaningful search.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.564049955Z"}
{"id":"7e5ee75b-07f7-4ad5-8e40-a4a03a582523","expr":"paramTypes != null","rationale":"ParamTypes may be empty, but the varargs array itself should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.564049955Z"}
{"id":"e67fda64-ae5d-4485-9fc6-ed8a727f4249","expr":"(methodName.length() > 0) || (paramTypes.length >= 0)","rationale":"Method name should be non-empty or the paramTypes length is measured.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.564049955Z"}
{"id":"e29fb264-a8d3-4bfe-a7a5-845d881eee50","expr":"clazz.isInterface() || !clazz.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Typically, methods searched for are not primitives or are interface types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.564049955Z"}
{"id":"f305d657-d23f-4179-9971-b4a852c15fb8","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts clazz must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.598818718Z"}
{"id":"bc32f8ea-d928-49de-9c93-7a0f2e222c61","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"The method asserts methodName must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.598818718Z"}
{"id":"2df8ee28-64eb-41b1-8600-c0b7f0924614","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"Demonstrates usage of valid clazz instance, but not a useful invariant; included for demonstration.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.598818718Z"}
{"id":"c483be27-8d5b-4152-8555-0185f11d7116","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null Method or throws an exception, so result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.602811785Z"}
{"id":"d5df9338-0116-491e-bf60-e04a95d06c96","expr":"result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"The returned method must have the requested methodName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.602811785Z"}
{"id":"063b4655-b668-477f-9a47-2dfd205aa897","expr":"result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"The returned method is declared by a class assignable from clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.602811785Z"}
{"id":"7d83f17b-e2ae-4263-87c7-7cc169ab4b59","expr":"!result || clazz.isMemberClass()","rationale":"If the result is true, then clazz.isMemberClass() must be true because inner classes are member classes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isInnerClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.621245317Z"}
{"id":"092b3881-85ac-4486-b85c-3719dc16ee78","expr":"result == (clazz.isMemberClass() && !clazz.isLocalClass() && !clazz.isAnonymousClass())","rationale":"Inner class usually means a member class but not a local or anonymous class, so this is a reasonable extended invariant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isInnerClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.621245317Z"}
{"id":"0329467f-51be-49e5-8ee3-690f6f0b6cb7","expr":"paramTypes != null || result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"When paramTypes is null and a method is returned, it must have the matching methodName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.642669057Z"}
{"id":"acd84c47-510e-44d3-9717-9b6729554463","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(clazz) || clazz.isAssignableFrom(result.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The returned method, if any, is from or assignable to the input class, reflecting usual getMethod semantics.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.642669057Z"}
{"id":"6b63b234-a287-4dd4-b714-f4bcd347410c","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Method requires clazz to be non-null to proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.651212400Z"}
{"id":"68c3113b-8a16-41eb-8645-bca1b11b8b6d","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"Method requires methodName to be non-null to proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.651212400Z"}
{"id":"85aa0022-8220-4011-b884-c20ca2719646","expr":"paramTypes == null || paramTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"Parameter paramTypes is declared as an array or null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.651212400Z"}
{"id":"bf5f01cb-9d51-487f-ac83-976b8ce0370d","expr":"methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"Methods generally require non-empty method names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.651212400Z"}
{"id":"b5f28284-33fc-407c-8077-fdebb2390849","expr":"(! (paramTypes != null)) || paramTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"If paramTypes is non-null, its length is zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.651212400Z"}
