{"id":"88bac298-a94a-4a79-bc21-5ae78327fed8","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"The method asserts that methodName must not be null on entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.718128140Z"}
