{"id":"845b32bb-9eb3-40bc-9e78-6a25a8d2c923","expr":"methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"Method names are valid Java identifiers or strings; length > 0 is typical and reflects meaningful input.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.718128140Z"}
