{"id":"967656dc-fda7-4527-83c5-effe60ffba52","expr":"result == null || result.isInterface()","rationale":"The method aims to get an interface method if possible, so the returned Method either is null or represents an interface method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.781304781Z"}
