{"id":"29e58551-b405-4fe9-9fe9-176431286224","expr":"result == null || (targetClass != null && targetClass.isInterface() && targetClass.isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass()) || !targetClass.isInterface())","rationale":"When an interface method is found, the targetClass must be an interface assignable from the method's declaring class, or targetClass is not an interface.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.807905978Z"}
