{"id":"71f0b502-1653-4bbf-898e-b33559735982","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a Method instance, either the input method or a publicly accessible variant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.921836112Z"}
