{"id":"055da702-1e67-4d53-be85-9353836954a8","expr":"method != null","rationale":"Since 'method' is the primary argument to be inspected, it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:43.969836153Z"}
