{"id":"d3678684-b6f8-49a8-b2da-a154421b75a6","expr":"classDesc.getName().contains(result.getSimpleName())","rationale":"Typically the classDesc name string should contain the name of the resolved class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.ConfigurableObjectInputStream#resolveClass(ObjectStreamClass):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/core/ConfigurableObjectInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.619717651Z"}
