{"id":"fa381f1d-9746-487b-b6a4-f3cf7283e4de","expr":"buffer.length() > 0 && buffer.charAt(0) == '['","rationale":"The method always appends '[' as the first character to buffer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleStart(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.635472259Z"}
