{"id":"075005cd-7db6-4ad8-954d-b1417b80e090","expr":"buffer.indexOf(\"@\") >= 0","rationale":"The character '@' is always appended to buffer, so it should be present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.636892052Z"}
{"id":"6563cef7-746c-4035-b492-2fa3e284d94c","expr":"obj != null || buffer.indexOf(\"null\") >= 0","rationale":"If obj is null, ObjectUtils.getIdentityHexString(obj) returns \"null\" string appended to buffer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.636892052Z"}
{"id":"5924aa1a-2824-487b-a2fa-6ada8d12e7ab","expr":"!buffer.toString().endsWith(\"@\")","rationale":"The buffer ends with the identity string, not just '@'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleIdentityHashCode(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.636892052Z"}
{"id":"b9f8ee47-5795-49d1-bbfa-b466d93cccd2","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The method invokes buffer.append, so buffer must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.638610127Z"}
{"id":"8fb9713c-9058-4a8e-b577-b761e0b4ce1a","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The method immediately calls buffer.append, so buffer must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.638709904Z"}
{"id":"e21cb7b3-4bfc-466f-b466-ff5868c4c472","expr":"buffer.length() > 0","rationale":"Since the method appends a character ']', the buffer length is increased, so it should be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.638610127Z"}
{"id":"cad5cd63-29f3-49e6-9f5b-f25b7fb36c80","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"StringBuilder length is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.638709904Z"}
{"id":"825aafd4-4d1e-4aec-824e-b57e76d34213","expr":"o == null || true","rationale":"The parameter o is passed but the method implementation does not read or depend on it, so its state doesn't constrain the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.638709904Z"}
{"id":"7c04d9e8-209c-4e77-8109-6317f15db2a7","expr":"buffer.charAt(buffer.length() - 1) == ']'","rationale":"The method appends ']' at the end, so the last character in buffer should be ']'","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.638610127Z"}
{"id":"e34ed6ca-8798-4894-ab6b-c0b0b1421ac7","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The buffer is used for appending strings in styleFieldStart and styleValue, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.639850101Z"}
