{"id":"2503a646-4913-4524-ace5-6f3fbd4dbfa6","expr":"fieldName.length() > 0","rationale":"A non-empty fieldName is expected to meaningfully style the field name in the output.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.639850101Z"}
{"id":"8b5a641f-b9b1-4483-b565-a86b6bb226c9","expr":"(value == null) || (value.toString() != null)","rationale":"If the value is non-null, its toString must be non-null to be styled correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.639850101Z"}
{"id":"d6ac9bd0-fb0e-483d-af02-4ce222831694","expr":"buffer.length() >= 0","rationale":"The buffer length is always non-negative as a property of StringBuilder.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.639850101Z"}
{"id":"0f819f0e-1daa-41e0-8458-de78deb1c4f2","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"buffer must be non-null since it is used for appending in styleField methods","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleField(StringBuilder,String,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.640241057Z"}
