{"id":"90d45022-7c14-4f7c-84ab-c9c8efd786dc","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The method calls append() on buffer, so buffer must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleFieldStart(StringBuilder,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.641892726Z"}
