{"id":"009103a0-770a-450a-96f8-f7b95cc67b21","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a quoted version of the input string, result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.670663117Z"}
{"id":"f3c52260-97bd-4650-99a9-d3bdea61c818","expr":"result.startsWith(\"\\\"\")","rationale":"The method prepends a quote character to the input string before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.670663117Z"}
