{"id":"0b739e00-edde-40ad-8ae3-0413495a78ed","expr":"result.length() == str.length() + 2","rationale":"The output string encloses the input string with one quote character at the start and one at the end.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.670663117Z"}
{"id":"4fbd8b02-ac82-4cbe-975f-4d8c92b12a60","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method is likely expected to be called with a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.671079140Z"}
{"id":"a2ba2f14-020d-4464-9a05-72e07820138a","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"Typically, styleClass methods process reference classes, not primitives.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.671079140Z"}
{"id":"5ea77547-fec3-4e03-a5e4-0f4733c916d7","expr":"result.substring(1, result.length() - 1).equals(str)","rationale":"The method builds the result by adding quotes around str, so str must be the substring excluding the surrounding quotes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.670663117Z"}
{"id":"e1c0d637-3e78-43e8-952d-0c745f3c4bd6","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"A Class object's getName() must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.671079140Z"}
{"id":"c372db97-3f84-4a10-9512-cde133acccf3","expr":"!clazz.isArray() || clazz.getComponentType() != null","rationale":"If clazz represents an array type, its component type must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.671079140Z"}
{"id":"499ebe9c-1078-4c5d-a1f1-161aeacdacff","expr":"clazz.getSimpleName() != null","rationale":"The simple name of the class should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.671079140Z"}
{"id":"8b9f1134-ef97-4531-86bd-3b546cfc0c1f","expr":"clazz != null && result != null && result.equals(clazz.getSimpleName()) || result.equals(clazz.getName()) || result.equals(clazz.toString()) || true","rationale":"Given styleClass returns a styled String of clazz, result is related to clazz's name or string representation","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672436145Z"}
{"id":"cb6be5ef-dd95-46cf-8b73-e27b4ea29fe5","expr":"result != null && result.length() > 0","rationale":"If result is non-null, it should be a non-empty string","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672436145Z"}
{"id":"96cb1ae2-f410-4059-97ef-abba15253ec7","expr":"clazz != null || result == null","rationale":"If clazz is null, result may be null but not vice versa","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672436145Z"}
{"id":"cc8cfa92-7a92-429a-abb9-14816e214a10","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must be non-null to safely call methodStyler.apply(method) without NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672769983Z"}
{"id":"038c7928-b0c7-4820-b855-8b1222b61946","expr":"result != null && result.indexOf(' ') < 0","rationale":"Result string usually has no spaces since class names don't contain spaces","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672436145Z"}
{"id":"d17351dc-28aa-4edc-9e58-1812ddd9ead3","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"A Method object always has an associated declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672769983Z"}
{"id":"b73237e6-6219-4af7-b2ed-fb4dbc260295","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method.getName() returns the method's name string, which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672769983Z"}
{"id":"486e89f5-a639-4d16-b2f7-020ccacef01e","expr":"clazz != null && clazz.isPrimitive() == (result.length() <= 8)","rationale":"The length of the returned string may be small if the class is primitive; this is a heuristic","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672436145Z"}
{"id":"93d614bf-16d6-4fa6-9b41-09d48b310265","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Java Method objects always have zero or more parameters, never negative count.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672769983Z"}
{"id":"0266236a-5bc8-4fd3-9c4d-191aeb2f290d","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Every Method has a return Type object associated with it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.672769983Z"}
{"id":"4656caf3-74d7-4030-900e-7e574c05419c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned string result should never be null, as it is the value of methodStyler.apply(method).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.674574189Z"}
{"id":"301a8de6-5fbf-4ea8-8b1f-5432448525ea","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The styling of the method usually produces a non-empty string representing the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.674574189Z"}
{"id":"342200f2-95a2-4673-9c1d-40d0f5276d69","expr":"result.contains(method.getName())","rationale":"The styled string typically includes the method's name to identify it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.674574189Z"}
{"id":"21b3abf4-a3b2-4da5-8581-7f56b7240dae","expr":"result.length() > 0 && method.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Both the method's name and the styled string are expected to be non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.674574189Z"}
{"id":"0b0639dd-6110-43c8-a503-08fb5b5c5fd4","expr":"map != null","rationale":"The map parameter must be non-null for the method to execute correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.675242016Z"}
{"id":"77769068-553b-4999-a783-39ac18f5e3af","expr":"map.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size of the map cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.675242016Z"}
{"id":"13ce6d69-cd6a-4cda-8ec2-be72db5402aa","expr":"map.entrySet() != null","rationale":"map.entrySet() always returns a non-null set of entries.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.675242016Z"}
{"id":"c723ddbe-b5f7-48bb-ad8e-6cd80e99aad1","expr":"(map.isEmpty() && map.size() == 0) || (!map.isEmpty() && map.size() > 0)","rationale":"Emptiness of the map correlates correctly with its size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.675242016Z"}
{"id":"20e45481-29db-4073-ac10-d310cde3b85a","expr":"map == null || (result.length() >= 2)","rationale":"If map is not null, the minimal string is '{}', length 2.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.676549798Z"}
{"id":"3c6d6fd9-fdce-42c3-ae1b-c38996c07b45","expr":"result != null","rationale":"StringJoiner.toString() returns a string with the formatted content, not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.676549798Z"}
{"id":"a6f8b0a6-c1ae-4c4d-a31d-f4025952a67b","expr":"collection != null","rationale":"The method iterates over collection, so it must not be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.677044059Z"}
{"id":"2c5d6596-4734-49e4-956f-afecd1b09309","expr":"collection.size() >= 0","rationale":"Collection size is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.677044059Z"}
{"id":"d29d5d56-d138-4d94-ac7c-d6c242f548ef","expr":"collection.isEmpty() == (collection.size() == 0)","rationale":"isEmpty() is true iff size() == 0 by specification.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.677044059Z"}
{"id":"0e77f9bc-87cd-4012-92f8-fdcde4055db1","expr":"result.startsWith(\"[\") && result.endsWith(\"]\")","rationale":"The method uses StringJoiner with '[' and ']' which guarantees these characters will wrap the string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.678423405Z"}
{"id":"43572f51-11ae-45dc-9523-996139e60ff3","expr":"result.equals(\"[]\") || collection.size() > 0","rationale":"An empty collection yields '[]', non-empty collection result is different from '[]'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.678423405Z"}
{"id":"09165245-a59e-4fcf-8ab5-b11b6f8c6f56","expr":"!result.equals(\"[]\") || collection.isEmpty()","rationale":"The result equals '[]' if and only if the collection is empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.678423405Z"}
{"id":"c5270a34-479d-41fa-bd92-9aab893bf142","expr":"result.length() >= 2","rationale":"The string always contains the opening and closing brackets, so minimum length is 2.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.678423405Z"}
{"id":"6d1d2dcd-196e-4984-84ae-33fdeb258565","expr":"array != null","rationale":"The method iterates over the array, so the input array must not be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.678955968Z"}
{"id":"3536d327-4ac0-408f-a125-460a90a44b5d","expr":"result.contains(\",\") == (collection.size() > 1)","rationale":"The StringJoiner adds ', ' between elements, so commas appear if collection has more than one element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.678423405Z"}
{"id":"9a1bba32-b735-43ca-af68-5cfb3a1aa183","expr":"array.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length in Java is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.678955968Z"}
{"id":"c76a15a8-7fa1-4241-8958-dc6f4ee1f5eb","expr":"result.startsWith(\"[\") && result.endsWith(\"]\")","rationale":"The result string represents the styled array enclosed in square brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.679925183Z"}
{"id":"b56e834a-b44d-4fa6-bf90-31a54bf01a17","expr":"(array.length == 0 && result.equals(\"[]\")) || (array.length > 0 && !result.equals(\"[]\"))","rationale":"The result is \"[]\" only when the array is empty; otherwise, it contains at least one element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.679925183Z"}
{"id":"acc4095f-9328-4ef1-adbd-ac4d1fbbf012","expr":"result.length() >= 2","rationale":"The result string always has at least the opening and closing brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.679925183Z"}
{"id":"86930463-f57a-4fcc-a2eb-131dd3589569","expr":"!result.contains(\", ]\")","rationale":"The resulting string should not have a comma immediately before the closing bracket.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleArray(Object[]):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.679925183Z"}
{"id":"e9ff07c2-42f7-4b6a-a3df-97f352db4b00","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter cannot be null to generate its signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.680713757Z"}
{"id":"756d0b9d-78ff-4bb5-aead-45e68c66e3be","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Java reflection guarantees getName() returns non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.680713757Z"}
{"id":"f13b8e4b-3749-4926-91cf-ab2adf917767","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"method.getParameterTypes() never returns null according to JDK spec.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.680713757Z"}
{"id":"1cbefb69-7b4d-40c4-9611-fb48a7b645dc","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.680713757Z"}
{"id":"1edc5ebb-2cad-4ec0-ac7d-fea172fde686","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The Java API guarantees that String.format returns a non-null String, so result is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.682289103Z"}
{"id":"5727798b-e032-422f-8065-c8438dd881e4","expr":"result.startsWith(method.getName() + \"(\")","rationale":"The format string puts method name followed by '(' before the parameter list, so the result must start like that.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.682289103Z"}
{"id":"41e8c0f4-823b-4d64-85b6-90a761506eb9","expr":"result.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The String.format call appends a closing parenthesis at the end of the signature string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.682289103Z"}
{"id":"1d7043a9-4665-4470-882f-5f5449cc9830","expr":"result.contains(\"(\") && result.indexOf('(') < result.indexOf(')')","rationale":"The signature syntax enforces an opening parenthesis that must appear before the closing parenthesis in the result string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#toSimpleMethodSignature(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.682289103Z"}
{"id":"067314ba-2fb6-44c1-9a2d-8fee320cc35d","expr":"out != null","rationale":"The store method requires a valid OutputStream to write to.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(OutputStream,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.683030629Z"}
{"id":"d0e427d5-c038-4185-8cbb-304d68e698e5","expr":"comments == null || comments.length() >= 0","rationale":"If comments is provided, its length must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(OutputStream,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.683030629Z"}
{"id":"6e60b2e3-f260-4b3b-b6ca-b26f2c8d9870","expr":"out != null","rationale":"The method requires a non-null OutputStream to write properties.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(OutputStream,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.683805998Z"}
{"id":"3a06650e-78cb-4408-b058-476375b70a15","expr":"writer != null","rationale":"The method writes to the provided writer, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.SortedProperties#store(Writer,String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/SortedProperties.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:12:48.684697366Z"}
