{"id":"7b3b8aa9-b8d5-4c50-a333-9d2097901557","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new ResourcePropertySource instance, so result is guaranteed to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.DefaultPropertySourceFactory#createPropertySource(String,EncodedResource):PropertySource<?>","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/DefaultPropertySourceFactory.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:23.640354238Z"}
