{"id":"7ed3b71b-9236-4cc4-88c0-4d0371a2282c","expr":"separator == null || separator.length() > 0","rationale":"The separator parameter, if not null, is expected to be a non-empty string, consistent with typical separator usage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#setSeparator(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:23.643402465Z"}
