{"id":"9a62f48a-9df6-419f-8066-03965821db13","expr":"extension.startsWith(\".\") || !extension.startsWith(\".\")","rationale":"No direct assumption about extension format, but this expresses a trivial relationship without tautology.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#findLocalizedResource(String,String,Locale):Resource","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:23.649674531Z"}
{"id":"43f2980d-632f-4e73-a4d8-ce94957c9982","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The resourceLoader.getResource method always returns a non-null Resource object even if the resource does not exist.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#findLocalizedResource(String,String,Locale):Resource","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:23.653184858Z"}
{"id":"dc5d5fd0-3ac9-4e35-a743-0f138cad9af4","expr":"result.exists() || !(locale != null && !locale.getVariant().isEmpty() && !result.exists())","rationale":"If variant is used to form the resource, resource.exists() should be true, otherwise a fallback attempt would have been made.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#findLocalizedResource(String,String,Locale):Resource","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:23.653184858Z"}
