{"id":"924bf0dc-5c18-478d-8fac-73dd427fdd17","expr":"result.exists() || !(locale != null && !locale.getLanguage().isEmpty() && !result.exists())","rationale":"If resource for language localization was checked and not found, fallback to less specific or non-localized resource happens.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#findLocalizedResource(String,String,Locale):Resource","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:23.653184858Z"}
{"id":"7f5434c5-232a-4794-b295-601434985120","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Because the sharedInstance field is initialized lazily and returned, result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.DefaultParameterNameDiscoverer#getSharedInstance():ParameterNameDiscoverer","file":"org/springframework/core/DefaultParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:23.996370148Z"}
{"id":"a79fc078-4245-4822-abc5-42b49df224b3","expr":"pnd != null","rationale":"Typically, a method that adds an item to a collection expects the item (pnd) to be non-null because adding null may not be allowed or meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.PrioritizedParameterNameDiscoverer#addDiscoverer(ParameterNameDiscoverer):void","file":"org/springframework/core/PrioritizedParameterNameDiscoverer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:24.125639161Z"}
