{"id":"64c8409d-ee42-4a94-8de4-a64cd838ebad","expr":"properties != null","rationale":"Since the method assigns 'properties' to 'localProperties' array, 'properties' being non-null is a reasonable assumption to ensure proper assignment.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:24.491469844Z"}
