{"id":"aec56a1c-297a-4152-828a-a051218c9986","expr":"location != null","rationale":"The method sets locations as a new array containing location, which only makes sense if location is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:24.494194202Z"}
