{"id":"220d3f04-a639-4a25-8a07-64f9e93ef2cc","expr":"locations != null","rationale":"If locations were null, setting it is still allowed but generally it is expected non-null here to maintain state integrity.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocations(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:24.497799178Z"}
