{"id":"b05a6870-338d-40c7-b814-356d15e4420f","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method uses props to load properties data, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:26.577912377Z"}
