{"id":"a6f37568-d7a2-4689-998b-210439f76000","expr":"!value.isEmpty() || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the input value is empty, method returns value unchanged, so result should be empty also.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#resolveNestedPlaceholders(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:33.366350507Z"}
