{"id":"c798102c-c76c-42f8-8ea6-3aa00acc6981","expr":"text != null","rationale":"Since the method replaces placeholders in the provided text, the text should be a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#doResolvePlaceholders(String,PropertyPlaceholderHelper):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:33.369504263Z"}
