{"id":"0d61e8ef-fc0a-4500-8fc4-acf0829e311e","expr":"text.length() >= 0","rationale":"Text length is inherently non-negative and might be relevant for understanding the input size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#doResolvePlaceholders(String,PropertyPlaceholderHelper):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:33.369504263Z"}
