{"id":"9cac28ba-02a6-42cc-a8f4-2ee1a95e97f0","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method uses 'name' as a field name string which should not be null for meaningful method invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addReadMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.142625321Z"}
