{"id":"bf0ff680-a22f-4a89-bab5-ad48fa99a9a1","expr":"sig.getArgumentTypes() != null","rationale":"The Signature object usually provides non-null argument types array to represent the method's parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.150744530Z"}
