{"id":"a71c852b-1271-4f9b-a046-3c8b1b772e04","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method concatenates name with a string; hence name should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.165192411Z"}
