{"id":"54f96898-fe60-4eca-bd3d-991d87199413","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"A method name is normally not empty; concatenating with a prefix suggests name is a meaningful identifier.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.165192411Z"}
