{"id":"f43f2ef4-2ba8-4b74-9078-c58946bca209","expr":"result.getDescriptor().equals(\"()\" + desc)","rationale":"The result signature descriptor is \"()\" + desc.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.168730346Z"}
{"id":"a7c2ceba-c355-4f0b-9004-a56dd52aa719","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method concatenates name to create a new method signature string, so name must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.169743027Z"}
{"id":"6dbac990-916a-42b3-be80-6a5da2194daf","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The method appends desc inside parentheses as part of the signature; desc cannot be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.169743027Z"}
