{"id":"bc851f1e-2a68-4ce9-b109-3ab2e412040e","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"'owner' is expected to be a non-empty string representing a class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.313431561Z"}
{"id":"61a908bb-290f-4e5a-8144-db434646fc19","expr":"desc != null && desc.length() > 0","rationale":"Annotation descriptor strings are non-null and typically non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.314769776Z"}
{"id":"3d1e998e-691f-4826-bb80-8e3c88444b45","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean flag indicating the visibility of the annotation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.314769776Z"}
{"id":"ba47ce2a-b3ee-4055-8b4c-d5e4ba8a7c08","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method uses attr as a parameter to another method call without a prior null check, so attr must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.318411708Z"}
