{"id":"311292b3-4b80-40e2-8c08-5be3a12dc31d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns target.visitMethod, which is generally expected to return a non-null MethodVisitor, result != null holds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.338404200Z"}
