{"id":"38ac1c57-9595-407f-a94e-647fbba84709","expr":"nLocal >= 0","rationale":"nLocal represents the number of local variables, which cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.352795985Z"}
{"id":"24f0b92d-5c94-429e-89e3-ad32fa6c44d1","expr":"nStack >= 0","rationale":"nStack represents the number of stack elements, which cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.352795985Z"}
{"id":"ada9b5aa-9601-4bb2-abda-2087a0bf655e","expr":"local != null || nLocal == 0","rationale":"If there are zero local variables, local may be null; otherwise, it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.352795985Z"}
{"id":"c870da8b-5959-4fb7-99ae-06d57592b74a","expr":"stack != null || nStack == 0","rationale":"If the stack size is zero, stack array may be null; otherwise, it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.352795985Z"}
{"id":"d0fc6699-a15a-4172-b275-534b0d62337d","expr":"local != null && nLocal <= local.length","rationale":"The nLocal count cannot be greater than the available slots in the local array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.352795985Z"}
{"id":"7152adb2-d267-47b3-a780-63d1f66ccc95","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since visitAnnotationDefault() returns the combined result of two visits, the result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.357926195Z"}
{"id":"e450bc10-3b75-4ae5-8f89-c247c96950fa","expr":"result.visitAnnotationDefault() == null","rationale":"The returned visitor might delegate some calls to underlying visitors, and calling visitAnnotationDefault() on it could return null as is common for certain visitors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.357926195Z"}
{"id":"d201752d-b4b0-41ab-8f7a-94f0d4e9da40","expr":"result.hashCode() != 0","rationale":"To distinguish instances, the result object should have a stable and non-zero hash code.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.357926195Z"}
{"id":"e5399f39-9596-43b6-9854-08b0f5d75123","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc should be a valid descriptor string required to create an annotation visitor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.358347149Z"}
