{"id":"eb5f247e-a134-4e04-8a48-aafe009fa368","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc should be a non-empty string to represent valid annotation descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.358347149Z"}
{"id":"fb3b5465-54ae-4f88-a170-7756183a0f90","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a combined object from two other visitAnnotation calls, the result is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.360261761Z"}
{"id":"5b8943da-efdb-4040-a92d-52a8128fbccb","expr":"!result.equals(null)","rationale":"The result object is expected to be a non-null AnnotationVisitor instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.360261761Z"}
