{"id":"ecbb610a-e9e5-4f43-9123-69ae8a2e47e9","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Description strings for annotations are expected to be non-null as they represent type descriptors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameterAnnotation(int,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.364541707Z"}
