{"id":"aef6cfda-0acb-4c2b-9b27-b1f1a54b1e74","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"Since attr is passed directly to mv1.visitAttribute and mv2.visitAttribute without null checks, attr should not be null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.367605347Z"}
