{"id":"6b35f67b-59f3-40b4-9fa6-5e0a51fe686f","expr":"attr.data != null || attr.length == 0","rationale":"An Attribute with no data might have data as null only if length is zero, otherwise data should be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.367605347Z"}
{"id":"a6638234-e5cb-4c74-bc1e-ddca1e3ff3b6","expr":"attr.isCodeAttribute() == false","rationale":"Depending on the attribute, this could be true as common attributes differ; assuming false as typical non-code attribute","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.367605347Z"}
{"id":"b2b8026b-9ca4-48df-8807-2ad4a0c41a81","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method calls visitAttribute on mv1 and mv2 with attr; attr must not be null for these calls to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.370536809Z"}
{"id":"a349b90d-086e-41b4-a577-50b12efc5349","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"Opcode for JVM instructions is typically between 0 and 255 inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.376793654Z"}
