{"id":"3220d90d-211f-4473-b552-bb54e8a66900","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode values correspond to bytecode instruction opcodes which are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.387079421Z"}
