{"id":"3ce41fc9-1246-41f9-9a30-8f47fd9280ed","expr":"opcode <= 255","rationale":"Opcode values are defined within a byte range (0 to 255) as per JVM standard.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.387079421Z"}
{"id":"539e8bce-c745-484c-93cd-fa9f4e598b7c","expr":"var <= 65535","rationale":"Local variable indices are limited by the JVM's maximum method local variables count, typically up to 65535.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.387079421Z"}
{"id":"50e8fa3b-31d1-4eec-b69b-7adffeeb199f","expr":"opcode != 0","rationale":"Variable instructions generally have meaningful opcode values, not nop (0).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.387079421Z"}
{"id":"26f71073-ace7-4b82-b8f2-f744f020373a","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"The opcode parameter should be a valid JVM opcode which are typically non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.392460825Z"}
