{"id":"11c914a7-b6c6-49a2-8dc6-c9156c4fd08d","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode often represents JVM instruction codes that are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.394077946Z"}
