{"id":"1a84321e-b5d7-43b3-b92e-413605c4bcf9","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"opcode is expected to be a valid bytecode instruction opcode, typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.406710682Z"}
