{"id":"398921f8-c605-4faa-9374-fbaefb678e51","expr":"(opcode >= 182 && opcode <= 185) == itf","rationale":"The itf boolean indicates whether the method is an interface method, and opcode value corresponds accordingly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.417178683Z"}
{"id":"2439932d-dcc7-4cfb-8213-7a83b158f391","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"Method descriptor strings have a standard format starting with '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.417178683Z"}
{"id":"64caa08a-fa81-4d4c-8a33-ff583a4aa202","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The method name is a non-empty string identifying the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.417178683Z"}
{"id":"41798baf-0fcb-40b9-b64f-735a06c6826b","expr":"opcode == 183 || opcode == 182 || opcode == 185 || opcode == 184","rationale":"opcode corresponds to method invocation instructions like invokespecial, invokevirtual, invokeinterface, or invokestatic.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.417178683Z"}
{"id":"b849a025-5f8d-46a5-85f3-f4c90104b825","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method delegates jump instructions to two other method visitors, so label must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.420288361Z"}
{"id":"7abd037c-1e39-437d-a8cc-089b3e97638b","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"The opcode parameter represents a JVM bytecode instruction opcode which are in the range 0 to 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.420288361Z"}
{"id":"2fe8bc27-5c2a-4f86-8d8c-dc467566b578","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter typically represents a class or interface name and must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.421231490Z"}
{"id":"d2e3f476-c9ae-4a40-8dcb-1c272cd4d7df","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Method name must be defined for meaningful method invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.421231490Z"}
{"id":"c700ee69-edf2-4c00-9086-de16831cb84f","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Method descriptor is required to describe parameter and return types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.421231490Z"}
{"id":"0fa4d882-7f84-4a41-bc59-5a4d337db6b8","expr":"(opcode >= 0) && (opcode <= 255)","rationale":"Opcode is an unsigned byte value that identifies the bytecode instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.421231490Z"}
{"id":"305126bc-5dbb-4f4a-8d83-1634024d2add","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Since label is passed as an argument to visitJumpInsn calls, it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.423768818Z"}
{"id":"66517adb-e389-470b-8930-2a7a9f43a554","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode represents a bytecode operation code which are typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.423768818Z"}
{"id":"d1d661e8-ba1e-4a88-ba16-d87fb7862e3e","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The label parameter must not be null because it is passed to other methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.426351951Z"}
{"id":"41962e47-1589-449d-b8cd-ba4cf481475f","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"The constant 'cst' passed to visitLdcInsn is typically non-null as it's an operand for ldc instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.430242543Z"}
{"id":"fe631662-87eb-4afc-b298-8779545bba3c","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"The constant object cst is forwarded to two method visitors, so it is likely non-null to avoid NPE in the downstream visitLdcInsn calls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.432998082Z"}
{"id":"bf7c6e97-3827-4529-be93-a052fc3771b3","expr":"cst.getClass().isInstance(cst)","rationale":"cst is an Object so it is trivially an instance of its own class, reinforcing type consistency.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.432998082Z"}
{"id":"ff6c673d-2c18-45ff-99d9-ad9e556c65ed","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Since the method calls mv1.visitLabel(label) and mv2.visitLabel(label), label must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.435073247Z"}
{"id":"01d66f05-b0f5-487d-b320-9c1062fd78af","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"In Java bytecode, the variable index (var) used in IINC instructions is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.436797140Z"}
{"id":"a5afd942-ab63-4aff-9805-a547477fa715","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"Increment is usually non-zero since incrementing by zero would be a no-op.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.436797140Z"}
{"id":"c3f93d06-4003-42c3-9a30-a50968959400","expr":"increment >= -128 && increment <= 127","rationale":"In JVM bytecode, the IINC instruction's increment parameter is a signed byte, typically between -128 and 127.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.436797140Z"}
{"id":"a413c145-c819-4af6-a2b4-6dd27e1ce8f9","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"The increment parameter usually specifies a non-zero value since zero increment would be redundant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.440883149Z"}
{"id":"47032378-2f7e-47f9-8184-add48f685385","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"Java local variable indices are never negative, so var should be >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.440883149Z"}
{"id":"21991e80-ccad-4175-bc85-a6ef71e35062","expr":"Integer.valueOf(var).equals(Integer.valueOf(var))","rationale":"No meaningful invariant, just allowed method usage example","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.440883149Z"}
{"id":"9f4ed275-d034-4961-a522-123f7b4c12fd","expr":"(var & 1) == 0 || (var & 1) == 1","rationale":"Bitwise property; explicitly trivial but can be meaningful for more advanced reasoning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.440883149Z"}
{"id":"91cc90eb-876c-4880-8a68-b952bac7eeac","expr":"var < 65536","rationale":"Local variable indices typically fit in a 16-bit index.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.440883149Z"}
{"id":"3ae1d293-d0cf-4a22-8131-78ab90deeb1f","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels parameter is passed directly without null check, so it is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.443445163Z"}
{"id":"cab9b5cf-ed22-4880-8dfd-f7e6b8c3bd51","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"For the table switch instruction, max should be greater than or equal to min, as this represents a valid range of switch keys.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.443445163Z"}
{"id":"d099b5c1-73d2-4c00-8ca7-1483b48a77e5","expr":"labels.length == max - min + 1","rationale":"The labels array should have one label for each possible key value between min and max inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.443445163Z"}
{"id":"38282479-2ac2-49a8-9bba-6a517361cceb","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label for the switch instruction is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.443445163Z"}
{"id":"e310ee40-b609-4ac1-b4bd-3116fb2facac","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"The switch range must have max greater or equal to min for valid table switch","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.446935228Z"}
{"id":"90e83808-dff9-4f86-ae03-274467801e20","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels array parameter should not be null to properly dispatch switch cases","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.446935228Z"}
{"id":"9d2c1b26-1781-4431-bc5d-6f5590c2617b","expr":"labels.length == max - min + 1","rationale":"The number of labels must be exactly max-min+1 to cover all switch keys in the range","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.446935228Z"}
{"id":"0126c0a3-a6fb-4537-ae3e-d0119aa30e1d","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"A default label must always be provided","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.446935228Z"}
{"id":"90d5c3be-b371-43e8-8296-84071cfa2635","expr":"keys != null","rationale":"keys array must be non-null to represent switch keys","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.447521174Z"}
{"id":"cf6f4c30-e9c9-463c-94a7-0df47a69f371","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"labels array must be non-null to represent switch target labels","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.447521174Z"}
{"id":"27917d2e-4b1a-4a2f-9055-c7cc40c72ff7","expr":"keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"Each key corresponds to a label in lookup switch","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.447521174Z"}
{"id":"e3d50c0a-8837-4f86-a539-16ee56ee85a3","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"Default label for unmatched keys must be provided","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.447521174Z"}
{"id":"e0a08568-8556-473b-89f1-9999015596be","expr":"keys != null && labels != null && keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"The arrays keys and labels must be non-null and have equal length to represent the switch cases properly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.449995012Z"}
{"id":"010da682-06f9-41de-b51a-5bddffaf7b08","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label dflt should not be null as it specifies the default case of the switch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.449995012Z"}
{"id":"507af3e9-585f-479e-a405-9134ce2c6d80","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is passed to two method calls and therefore should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.453880663Z"}
{"id":"7b6a491c-0241-49d0-87c5-a2b37d7b86cf","expr":"dims > 0","rationale":"dims represents the number of dimensions for new multi-array creation and must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.453880663Z"}
{"id":"dc27f9fe-a6f2-4f49-9617-2937ca4df907","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc is expected to be a non-empty descriptor string for the type of the array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.453880663Z"}
{"id":"78e22b46-77f5-4af2-be80-80367e4e1e56","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"The descriptor for multi-dimensional arrays typically starts with '[' characters equal to dims.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.453880663Z"}
{"id":"b1e69a80-7e27-4d28-b5fd-0746c342c558","expr":"desc.indexOf('[') >= 0","rationale":"desc should contain at least one '[' as part of describing the multi-dimensional array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.453880663Z"}
{"id":"d91092a3-b910-496c-a9c9-bad36d2cc0d5","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start label of a try-catch block is typically expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.456422529Z"}
{"id":"760c2443-946e-4cef-a083-baae4980b695","expr":"end != null","rationale":"The end label of a try-catch block is typically expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.456422529Z"}
{"id":"4e757414-b630-41aa-a9e5-4c46adacf8c9","expr":"handler != null","rationale":"The handler label for a catch block should not be null since it represents a valid code region.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.456422529Z"}
{"id":"8f339974-2e33-4618-b4cc-d52fe34462ea","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The start label should be different from the end label to define a non-empty try block region.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.456422529Z"}
{"id":"a04f35ef-6fad-4789-ba19-6f8f3b17c222","expr":"type == null || type.length() > 0","rationale":"If the type string is not null, it should be non-empty indicating a valid exception type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.456422529Z"}
{"id":"be2ff6e0-4ebe-4f5e-96e8-cdf58a89de38","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor string 'desc' must not be null to represent a valid type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.457792985Z"}
{"id":"904d9d8b-9cc3-48b9-812e-2eb3213decf0","expr":"dims >= 1","rationale":"The number of dimensions specified by 'dims' should be at least 1 as arrays have at least one dimension.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.457792985Z"}
{"id":"fd47841a-5503-46dd-a2bf-c73bcc8d45ca","expr":"dims <= 255","rationale":"The JVM specification limits the number of array dimensions to 255 for multi-dimensional new array instructions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.457792985Z"}
{"id":"2226e1b7-bf35-4cf1-a2ff-57cc392b756e","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"The descriptor string should have length greater than zero to represent valid type information.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.457792985Z"}
{"id":"3599b815-fd1c-4b48-b376-c02747760d7a","expr":"start != null","rationale":"At the end of visitTryCatchBlock, start label must be non-null as it marks the beginning of the block.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.460743853Z"}
{"id":"e9065f11-cad4-47e3-a00b-e74b33490ed3","expr":"end != null","rationale":"At the end of visitTryCatchBlock, end label must be non-null as it marks the end of the block.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.460743853Z"}
{"id":"9763c6b1-52b8-4143-ab31-06e3f901a5c0","expr":"handler != null","rationale":"At the end of visitTryCatchBlock, handler label must be non-null since it marks the catch block.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.460743853Z"}
{"id":"b390994b-8529-47a2-96ce-7e7ccf667b9c","expr":"(type == null) || (type.length() > 0)","rationale":"Type string, if not null, should be a non-empty exception class name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.460743853Z"}
{"id":"81b6c515-7e3f-4cd5-a365-ea18dada5a63","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The try block must span a non-empty range so start and end labels should differ.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.460743853Z"}
{"id":"e35054df-05fa-419d-aece-ef297a1a2deb","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The parameter 'name' representing the variable's identifier is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.463224273Z"}
