{"id":"686cf92c-48bd-41aa-9d5f-685fc27f99e6","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The 'index' parameter identifies the slot position and must be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.463224273Z"}
{"id":"eca46e93-81dc-4fc3-bbd3-a59673980dd7","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc should be non-null because it is passed to the delegate visitTypeInsn methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.465575570Z"}
