{"id":"dc095fd8-2615-481e-8926-28a008870c05","expr":"name != null","rationale":"visitLocalVariable is expected to receive a non-null name for the local variable","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.467661134Z"}
{"id":"e5829844-99c0-47f2-97aa-09fd144bf3f1","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc must be non-null to represent a valid type descriptor","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.467661134Z"}
{"id":"3e3e429d-bcb3-4cb6-8254-e088279bb2d2","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"Index parameter represents the local variable slot index which is zero or positive","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.467661134Z"}
{"id":"1157bd23-d802-4bd7-8c72-b3ad103af0c0","expr":"start != null && end != null","rationale":"Labels define the scope of the local variable and must be defined","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.467661134Z"}
{"id":"dccf1ac9-68fd-47e9-adc6-d67a9d6c455c","expr":"start.getOffset() <= end.getOffset()","rationale":"For proper variable scope, the start label should occur before or at the end label","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.467661134Z"}
{"id":"e40ca020-5c1b-43b1-acc2-bce6cfb19552","expr":"line >= 0","rationale":"Line numbers in bytecode represent source code line numbers and are normally non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.470000619Z"}
{"id":"c1220315-9fae-43a7-b325-c323433694d7","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start label is used as a marker for a line number and must be a valid Label instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.470000619Z"}
{"id":"50d8c247-50cd-4583-9a84-1621e4903608","expr":"line > 0 || line == 0","rationale":"Technically covers lines at zero and positive, emphasizing line number range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.470000619Z"}
