{"id":"45567196-de6b-4b81-b7a7-e6fff9e37b63","expr":"maxStack >= maxLocals || maxLocals >= maxStack","rationale":"No inherent ordering, but are sizes so non-negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.473154379Z"}
{"id":"8b9440d9-8ec5-4370-a06f-81086fd6861b","expr":"maxStack >= 0","rationale":"Stack size cannot be negative in JVM bytecode verification.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.473285466Z"}
{"id":"4d8860be-ff99-4f7c-91c9-f4a36999ae0b","expr":"access >= 0 && access <= 0xFFFF","rationale":"Access flags typically fit within a 16-bit integer range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.483135762Z"}
{"id":"1cc45122-be8e-426f-a5d0-5b4ebab3d3bf","expr":"name == null || !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"If name is not null, it should not be empty as parameters generally have meaningful names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.483135762Z"}
{"id":"6ac6ff7a-845b-4aac-88f5-9e88580a0937","expr":"!(name != null && access == 0)","rationale":"If name is non-null, access flags are likely non-zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.483135762Z"}
{"id":"0dc989da-28b2-4db9-86e3-12933194479e","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method delegates to other visitParameter methods which likely require a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.480535917Z"}
{"id":"b2ba8741-c12a-4272-b7ca-a556df93fab1","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Typically access represents a set of bit flags; negative values are unusual.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.480535917Z"}
{"id":"f2674bd3-9855-4fda-aa80-f2e750fb9d47","expr":"(name == null) || (name.length() >= 0)","rationale":"Ensures that calling name.length() is safe in some usages in the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.480535917Z"}
{"id":"34d88e25-041d-4fb3-aab9-a82f3e66a963","expr":"maxLocals >= 0","rationale":"Number of local variables cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.473285466Z"}
{"id":"4f64efc1-cee9-43e2-9719-c4b08b3d8fe2","expr":"maxStack >= maxLocals","rationale":"Typically, stack size is at least as large as number of locals needed for method execution.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.473285466Z"}
{"id":"47c173b1-ec09-4495-a9d3-c6d88da386dd","expr":"maxStack <= 65535","rationale":"JVM spec limits stack size to a maximum of 65535.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.473285466Z"}
{"id":"a3722214-a874-4e7c-83f1-ffed0b89f79c","expr":"maxLocals <= 65535","rationale":"JVM spec limits local variables count to 65535.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.473285466Z"}
{"id":"5860ad26-e03b-440c-bb7e-d8abc6fbabd0","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The 'desc' parameter is a descriptor string likely required and non-null for type annotations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.488861456Z"}
{"id":"9fef4ea6-f36c-45c1-8836-72319abc0a8a","expr":"(typePath == null) || (typePath.getLength() >= 0)","rationale":"If typePath is not null, its length should be non-negative representing a valid path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.488861456Z"}
