{"id":"8b5c6d54-5cc6-4a74-9847-868ee165ffd7","expr":"typeRef <= 0xFFFF","rationale":"typeRef values are constrained to fit within 16 bits as per JVM spec for type annotations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.488861456Z"}
{"id":"fe5809e6-0af5-4584-a0fe-d5daa5b2bf8b","expr":"(desc.length() > 0)","rationale":"desc is a descriptor string expected to be non-empty for the annotation type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.488861456Z"}
{"id":"9d1c84ca-548e-4707-9065-83ec92cbe1c5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor from getInstance wrapping two visits is guaranteed non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.490198859Z"}
{"id":"6ca93645-4754-414f-842b-84442277a558","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Invocation of mv1 and mv2 passes name; name must be valid and non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.491180121Z"}
