{"id":"f63701d6-ae96-4754-bedd-2613bcec06dc","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method visitor's visitInvokeDynamicInsn requires a valid method name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.491531343Z"}
{"id":"0ddddbdf-4d48-4aeb-b0d1-6333e540ef5f","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The method descriptor specifies method signature and must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.491531343Z"}
{"id":"dac95e02-1d8e-49d8-9703-b24f9adecd0a","expr":"bsm != null","rationale":"The bootstrap method handle (bsm) must be non-null for a valid invoke dynamic instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.491531343Z"}
{"id":"c4dfd9d7-1904-4270-8a63-5830c0e7da31","expr":"bsmArgs != null","rationale":"The argument array to bootstrap method should exist, even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.491531343Z"}
{"id":"af2d24b9-be95-4eb2-a5da-be5584467de1","expr":"bsmArgs.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"The parameter bsmArgs is declared as Object but expected to be an Object array at runtime.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.491531343Z"}
{"id":"a8031f6d-4ef9-4e25-9a9f-a1512734a6b6","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an instance from AnnotationVisitorTee.getInstance, likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.496626437Z"}
{"id":"cc31b170-a1ca-4b13-b993-fe1d74e3adee","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc should be a non-null descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.497464518Z"}
{"id":"fe1e8977-4915-4998-ba2f-3a3bdef2513d","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"typeRef is a non-negative integer representing the type reference.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.497464518Z"}
{"id":"1d26fc61-833e-47d6-a2bf-98faf86e093c","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.497464518Z"}
{"id":"a07b6408-4ee9-4158-966e-aeb52d466769","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is expected to be a valid type descriptor string, thus should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.499496642Z"}
{"id":"ed2f2368-cd15-495c-b2b2-12b7981f737e","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.size() >= 0","rationale":"If typePath is not null, its size should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.499496642Z"}
{"id":"443baf7d-2e22-45fd-9194-3e720aef0e68","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"typeRef is generally a reference index and hence should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.499496642Z"}
{"id":"6ea146c7-646e-489d-bc21-d7b0ac46c5a5","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean parameter so it logically can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:39.499496642Z"}
