{"id":"a4180a53-62c6-4e62-b58e-b30f0f9e0863","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since invoke method ends by returning the result of fci.f1.invoke, which is likely non-null when there is no exception thrown.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invoke(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.774141621Z"}
