{"id":"b3e806e0-38d9-46da-aa17-99802fce76db","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a new array of Type objects corresponding to callbackTypes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.775765157Z"}
{"id":"cea2a352-d985-4570-bfc0-7106ea69e122","expr":"result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"By construction, result array is allocated with length equal to callbackTypes.length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.775765157Z"}
{"id":"15ac8641-8c00-4001-a32e-a107d1837f8d","expr":"callbackTypes == null || (result.length == callbackTypes.length)","rationale":"If callbackTypes is null, method may throw earlier or handle accordingly; otherwise length must match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.775765157Z"}
{"id":"0bedd5d7-000a-46e8-935e-33f127569822","expr":"callbacks != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null array of callbacks to operate correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.776862013Z"}
{"id":"1b566ebc-52c7-4f6d-8e1d-1d5fe7a9e630","expr":"callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"Array lengths in Java are always non-negative, so this holds at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.776862013Z"}
{"id":"4218f551-6c62-4bf6-ab27-9d63bebdcb13","expr":"result != null","rationale":"According to the method context, determineTypes returns a Type array which is assigned directly from another method call, which is expected not to return null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.777080444Z"}
{"id":"7fcd1c0b-3a1b-4d5e-9ce5-394587668519","expr":"callbacks == null || result.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"Typically determineTypes map each Callback to one Type, so array sizes are expected to be equal when callbacks is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.777080444Z"}
{"id":"f3d5d0fe-f23e-4d93-988e-6a665b7f70a8","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of result, an array, is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.777080444Z"}
{"id":"0993a75f-4356-4763-9c0b-7279945d2f4b","expr":"callbacks != null && callbacks.length == 0 || result.length == 0","rationale":"If the input callbacks array is empty, then the result array is expected to be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.777080444Z"}
{"id":"bd2b22f5-bfa6-4c1a-b043-c7de8c7e1148","expr":"callbacks != null","rationale":"The method creates an array using callbacks.length, so callbacks must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.777226078Z"}
{"id":"575d4fec-75a1-4588-91c7-c5e985e71eb1","expr":"callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.777226078Z"}
{"id":"bbfb8eda-c038-4a21-8f99-9a814ae8a395","expr":"checkAll == true || checkAll == false","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean parameter; this is trivial but explicitly stated","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.777226078Z"}
{"id":"2bf8b845-7107-4891-af3c-029cf044503f","expr":"callbacks.length == (callbacks == null ? 0 : callbacks.length)","rationale":"Length of callbacks if not null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.777226078Z"}
{"id":"9c761ed9-64a9-4892-b22b-606450aa740f","expr":"callbackTypes != null","rationale":"The method uses callbackTypes.length and callbackTypes[i], so callbackTypes must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.778330968Z"}
{"id":"34ddc7d0-6c50-418e-89a3-da6b335b65cf","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is naturally non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.778330968Z"}
{"id":"f2647a2e-239a-46b9-84c9-a5c5b7f6ffde","expr":"!checkAll || callbackTypes.length > 0","rationale":"If checkAll is true, the array likely contains types to check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.778330968Z"}
{"id":"5d065403-63ea-4661-b9aa-108275b46b45","expr":"callbackTypes != null","rationale":"The method immediately uses callbackTypes.length in array creation, so callbackTypes must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.779735102Z"}
{"id":"44b08b79-724a-4a80-8682-ac659a7b1ee1","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of an array in Java is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.779735102Z"}
{"id":"44f050b9-e408-403a-b757-8712ccb1463f","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0 && callbackTypes.length <= 1000","rationale":"Bounds hinting for array size; upper bound is speculative but common.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.779735102Z"}
{"id":"debe0dae-a4b5-49c0-9fa1-e93f428d0c92","expr":"callback != null","rationale":"The method body throws IllegalStateException if callback is null; so callback is guaranteed non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.780984093Z"}
{"id":"eeb0caa2-5452-4fa2-82f2-680d7d4160d7","expr":"callback.getClass() != null","rationale":"Every non-null object always has a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.780984093Z"}
{"id":"beaa6f1e-9a27-40c6-bf71-d028ac676eca","expr":"result != null && result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"The method returns an array of CallbackGenerator with the same length as callbackTypes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.781054015Z"}
{"id":"da7ce040-51f5-49bc-a2f3-8cd1656dfd80","expr":"callbackTypes != null || result == null","rationale":"The method may produce a null result only if input is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.781054015Z"}
{"id":"1feea8d6-8d69-4b37-a418-69dccba6ad0f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method initializes the result array before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.781054015Z"}
{"id":"c4417696-e248-44cb-b23b-6998c6c8c0e0","expr":"(result != null)","rationale":"Presuming that the determineType method never returns null, result is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.781613519Z"}
{"id":"33db94b6-36be-4547-ba39-d7c8404e57aa","expr":"result != null && result.getClass().isAssignableFrom(callback.getClass())","rationale":"The result Type is related to the class of the callback instance, reflecting that callback is an instance of a class compatible with the returned Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.781613519Z"}
{"id":"d135c3d4-2f0c-41c4-be86-a5c2406c911f","expr":"result != null && callback.getClass() != null","rationale":"Since callback is non-null, its class is also non-null and result is presumably non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.781613519Z"}
{"id":"e20cee6f-5996-47bc-9742-2932bf95feef","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new Type[] array of the same length as callbacks, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.782641504Z"}
{"id":"766a7f9b-c246-4b20-81b9-92d5c6b43ed0","expr":"result.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"The returned Type array length equals callbacks.length as seen from the code creating a new array of this length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.782641504Z"}
{"id":"32051260-d2b9-45af-9f3f-80c234702757","expr":"callbacks.length == 0 || (result[0] != null)","rationale":"If callbacks is non-empty, the first element of result is assigned the return of determineType which presumably returns a valid Type meaning result[0] != null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.782641504Z"}
{"id":"057d54ab-fb9d-4a8d-8f19-d2b21f3f84b0","expr":"!checkAll || (result.length > 0)","rationale":"The checkAll flag does not directly affect the length but given the code use, if checkAll is true, callbacks.length (and thus result.length) could be expected to be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.782641504Z"}
{"id":"12e995da-4997-4582-9cc9-6fbc25f8795d","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of an array in Java is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.782641504Z"}
{"id":"3a894baf-4954-4bee-b6ea-e95b9f447f9b","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The code generation requires a non-null ClassEmitter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784577729Z"}
{"id":"98b1ef68-ca18-42bb-8bb5-c298c58d86ae","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Code generation depends on a valid context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784577729Z"}
{"id":"ce496d26-e33a-4fae-bbda-4f7d25d8e965","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The method implementation list must be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784577729Z"}
{"id":"feb93ee0-cb83-4d30-8c1c-c03337a3a312","expr":"!methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, code generation implies methods are available.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784577729Z"}
{"id":"005c2dfc-6fbe-454b-b2c2-b8990d03a36b","expr":"methods.iterator() != null","rationale":"Having a valid iterator for methods is required before entering the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784577729Z"}
{"id":"3ada51fc-c3bd-45ec-9791-a02f561cbb5f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Because if no assignable type is found, an exception is thrown, so result is always assigned a non-null Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.785246418Z"}
{"id":"98dcc33d-553b-4b00-ad97-d089ec1d0a6a","expr":"!checkAll || result != null","rationale":"If !checkAll is true, early return occurs; but result is always non-null if return occurs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.785246418Z"}
{"id":"d9dd29f5-b72e-4737-9fad-f78aca2abf8f","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method calls isAssignableFrom on info.cls with callbackType, so callbackType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784750605Z"}
{"id":"e0f3b58f-65e8-4476-941a-070e05f44da1","expr":"callbackType.isInterface() || !callbackType.isArray()","rationale":"A callback type generally represents a class or interface type, not an array type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784750605Z"}
{"id":"3ebaea10-523c-42d2-80a9-a4c4b42a49f5","expr":"!checkAll || callbackType != null","rationale":"If checkAll is true, callbackType must be non-null to proceed with assignments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784750605Z"}
{"id":"53f8f15a-7f23-48d0-bc92-94c750df310d","expr":"checkAll || true","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean so it is either true or false (trivial but valid).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784750605Z"}
{"id":"2e251825-7f68-41e8-9eee-303f76f1466a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a generator retrieved from CALLBACKS, which is never null if found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.785410457Z"}
{"id":"cf4a9520-6ae5-4faf-8d64-a408e09dda52","expr":"result.getClass().getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"The generator class inherits from a superclass, indicating expected class hierarchy.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.785410457Z"}
{"id":"c47435a9-46c6-4e3c-8391-9850f7020ca6","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method calls callbackType.equals, so callbackType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784864409Z"}
{"id":"59a2d24b-35d3-46a6-a4b2-a7af691df822","expr":"callbackType.getClass().getName() != null","rationale":"The getClass name of callbackType is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784864409Z"}
{"id":"e288cbc5-79e6-431e-81ac-4b1b72d18a15","expr":"!callbackType.equals(null)","rationale":"callbackType.equals(null) should be false by the equals contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.784864409Z"}
{"id":"e1ed85c8-ef8d-4d0c-aa35-18b3e0e7f815","expr":"e != null","rationale":"CodeEmitter e is used as an object reference to invoke methods inside the method body, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.787665893Z"}
{"id":"d05b1570-aa1a-4b44-bdaf-059fa7af58e8","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context context is utilized for method calls like context.getImplSignature(...) hence must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.787665893Z"}
{"id":"f898ebfe-7e80-4332-9c43-c4bd5cfbba91","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The methods list is iterated over; it must be non-null to prevent NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.787665893Z"}
{"id":"c38a31d9-feda-4893-88a2-c06f98a661b3","expr":"methods.isEmpty() || methods.iterator().hasNext()","rationale":"If methods is not empty, its iterator must have elements to process in the method body.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.787665893Z"}
{"id":"53b5b55a-60d3-43be-845e-cdf5daddc926","expr":"methods != null && !methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The generate method iterates over methods, so methods list is expected to be non-null and typically non-empty for effective code generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.788799267Z"}
{"id":"9252adb2-2e8d-4c01-82cd-1544e121d256","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter should be non-null to declare fields and generate methods as the method implements code generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.788799267Z"}
{"id":"1dbd38c7-b8a5-454d-b46b-3a29f341d71c","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The context is used extensively to get implementation signature, begin method generation and emit callbacks, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.788799267Z"}
{"id":"7ea8706e-c93e-4b88-8df9-0e83a97a0fde","expr":"!methods.isEmpty() || ce.getName() != null","rationale":"If methods list is empty (unusual but possible), ClassEmitter should have a valid name to ensure the class context exists.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.788799267Z"}
{"id":"056235fd-f39c-4682-aff5-375ff3935eb9","expr":"result != null","rationale":"result is formed by concatenation of impl.getName() with a constant string, so it should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.794133831Z"}
{"id":"48eee268-3cfc-49d9-b760-714d95c09f65","expr":"result.startsWith(impl.getName())","rationale":"result always starts with the signature's name impl.getName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.794133831Z"}
