{"id":"2217d5a4-1d81-4169-b8eb-d88c8e171984","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter parameter 'ce' is essential for code generation to proceed and thus should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.803485768Z"}
{"id":"9319fe64-5168-4458-84f7-610ffbbacff9","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The Context parameter provides necessary contextual information for method generation and should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.803485768Z"}
{"id":"dbac55db-34df-44da-afa3-6e35f877304d","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The 'methods' list must be defined so the method implementation can iterate and generate code for them.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.803485768Z"}
