{"id":"c63d0b9f-4565-412f-9fa8-bbb2b5a9be33","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method initializes 'resolved' as a new HashMap and returns it or the same map after modifications, so 'result' cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.BridgeMethodResolver#resolveAll():Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/BridgeMethodResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.814594823Z"}
