{"id":"a43fcc1b-beb8-413b-9483-459e80f7af14","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"Version is expected to be a non-negative integer representing class file version.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.BridgeMethodResolver#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/BridgeMethodResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.815979500Z"}
