{"id":"3750a111-cb10-4baa-9249-8f3b17bcbf31","expr":"superName == null || !superName.equals(name)","rationale":"The superName should not be the same as the name to avoid recursive or incorrect inheritance loops.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.BridgeMethodResolver#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/BridgeMethodResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:42.817635098Z"}
