{"id":"3387bca2-f635-4505-9013-8553c1bf5f0c","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor string must be non-null as it is used to add a constant class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.208053256Z"}
{"id":"786d9d03-4ff1-40cf-84a4-e77a830b8221","expr":"numDimensions >= 1","rationale":"The number of dimensions for a new multi-array must be at least one.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.208053256Z"}
{"id":"0d655c6d-bb5f-477f-99a4-70df7ad57e74","expr":"!descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor must not be an empty string for the method to function correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.208053256Z"}
{"id":"5410febe-4167-440b-963b-7a17be2d4d7e","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The method uses descriptor to add a constant class symbol and does not check for null, so descriptor must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.222843853Z"}
