{"id":"3192be62-576f-4a42-b782-942c91f2f673","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean parameter, representing if an annotation is visible at runtime.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.274776949Z"}
