{"id":"c5ee5699-4be1-4651-a997-064a58604069","expr":"(access & 0x1000) == 0 || version >= 8","rationale":"If the ACC_RECORD bit is set in access, the version must be at least ASM8 (8).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.740389664Z"}
