{"id":"96606375-5d8a-4b4f-9391-2b6484d75cd0","expr":"source == null || source.length() > 0","rationale":"The 'source' string, if provided, usually represents a source file name and is unlikely to be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.743827697Z"}
