{"id":"93a6e57a-7889-4c1f-8182-b62907803f6f","expr":"attributePrototypes != null","rationale":"The method parameter 'attributePrototypes' is expected to be non-null for the method to operate correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.756391421Z"}
