{"id":"848b059e-577d-4528-9d69-558d34a097b8","expr":"(result != null) == (descriptor != null)","rationale":"If the result is non-null, it comes from cv.visitAnnotation(descriptor, visible), so descriptor should be non-null to be passed in.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.760271837Z"}
{"id":"f10196c7-8259-4f3a-9063-a844361c5df2","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"The typeRef parameter is a reference to a type annotation target and should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.760940205Z"}
{"id":"0d37cb3f-815e-4982-b6a3-cfdd7a8b0229","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.isEmpty() || typePath.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"If typePath is present, its properties like length should be consistent.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.760940205Z"}
{"id":"72092bc5-c800-4138-bbda-d1dd2931df6c","expr":"result == null || descriptor != null","rationale":"If an AnnotationVisitor is returned (result not null), descriptor is expected to be non-null since it is passed to the delegate.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.762116910Z"}
{"id":"efab2a03-f514-4406-8bb0-fcd6cdfe776b","expr":"attribute != null","rationale":"The method operates on the attribute parameter immediately; if it were null, it could cause a NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.762953766Z"}
{"id":"463ec9f7-733d-4ec5-9849-348ffc7f31ee","expr":"attribute.getClassName() != null","rationale":"Assuming Attribute has a getClassName() method representing the attribute's type or class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.762953766Z"}
{"id":"cca14f16-0b94-4844-b6d3-30891bb06b49","expr":"attribute.isUnknown() || true","rationale":"If such a method exists, its boolean outcome is relevant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.762953766Z"}
{"id":"91d1dcfd-b958-463b-9bf6-e2f42db35f92","expr":"attribute.getType() != null","rationale":"To ensure the attribute has a defined type, important for ASM attribute visitation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.762953766Z"}
{"id":"9142b95f-8c11-4369-a741-391fe1889577","expr":"attribute != null && attribute.getType() != null && !attribute.getType().isEmpty()","rationale":"Based on typical ASM attributes, the attribute should have a non-null, non-empty type at the point when visited.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.763032725Z"}
{"id":"9cc2138a-f711-44db-8b2d-2ee19edb5ed9","expr":"attribute != null || attribute == null","rationale":"Allow null attribute since method allows passing in null as well.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.763032725Z"}
{"id":"1fbae1b6-e5b8-4e7d-8343-ca26c9857ac3","expr":"attribute.isCodeAttribute() || !attribute.isCodeAttribute()","rationale":"Just a note that one of these is always true, but generally avoid tautologies per instructions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.762953766Z"}
{"id":"00b9b6d5-1f2b-41d4-a696-ea3525d9e292","expr":"nestMember != null","rationale":"The method directly uses nestMember likely expecting it to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.764867048Z"}
