{"id":"70445afd-a838-46eb-a93b-7e4b87896013","expr":"nestMember == null || nestMember.length() > 0","rationale":"If nestMember is present, it should have positive length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.765782031Z"}
{"id":"5fc339b0-5bce-4495-8144-1560f24f9cd9","expr":"permittedSubclass != null","rationale":"The method forwards permittedSubclass to another method without null check; it is likely expected not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.766554435Z"}
{"id":"4052ab70-8962-4ede-b675-05f6e309f5dd","expr":"permittedSubclass.length() > 0","rationale":"Permitted subclass name is generally expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.766554435Z"}
{"id":"6d7aaa4d-2a62-4613-9a5a-f0ed83f7c637","expr":"!permittedSubclass.contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Permitted subclass names likely refer to top-level classes, avoiding internal class '$' naming.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.766554435Z"}
{"id":"cc6d050c-632e-4791-9741-900c0d67c640","expr":"permittedSubclass.equals(permittedSubclass.trim())","rationale":"Permitted subclass names are expected not to have leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.766554435Z"}
{"id":"38f61937-4ce2-4e0d-9103-7c598ea265d1","expr":"permittedSubclass == null || permittedSubclass.length() > 0","rationale":"If permittedSubclass is not null, it should be a non-empty string representing a valid subclass name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.767357467Z"}
{"id":"960615ae-b936-4f1f-91df-8867b4de8bbc","expr":"permittedSubclass == null || !permittedSubclass.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Permitted subclass names typically should not contain whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.767357467Z"}
{"id":"db876d73-d747-446f-b18d-9429ef730d5c","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method requires a non-null name parameter to identify the inner class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769119134Z"}
{"id":"a125f448-e5b8-4a1d-9ba6-5066edba7e3a","expr":"(outerName == null) || (outerName.length() > 0)","rationale":"If outerName is not null, it likely refers to an outer class name with meaningful content.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769119134Z"}
{"id":"99d37c38-b73c-4d76-bf52-6f45eaf2bf00","expr":"(innerName == null) || (innerName.length() > 0)","rationale":"If innerName is not null, it likely refers to an inner class name with meaningful content.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769119134Z"}
{"id":"c08c1474-04cf-40c5-a007-43d4f577aa64","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"The access parameter represents modifier flags and should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769119134Z"}
{"id":"59f3b272-2a0d-401f-8d44-944c3ee68c01","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is usually non-null because it identifies the inner class being visited.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769188364Z"}
{"id":"28955397-7642-47fb-b000-abcea1438a4e","expr":"outerName == null || !outerName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The outerName parameter is either null or a valid non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769188364Z"}
{"id":"ad25a6b3-5d85-457e-b827-1b35cabcebd6","expr":"innerName == null || !innerName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The innerName parameter is either null or a valid non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769188364Z"}
{"id":"47488f31-1fed-4126-ba2a-5adcf95c4de4","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"The access parameter represents access flags and should be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769188364Z"}
{"id":"f20e04ea-9f23-403d-b0c7-d79e98cbe809","expr":"(innerName == null) || (name.endsWith(innerName))","rationale":"Typically, the innerName is a suffix of the full inner class name (name).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769119134Z"}
{"id":"2f172c4f-d654-4a85-8a36-ac9b1804189a","expr":"outerName == null || (name.startsWith(outerName) && innerName != null)","rationale":"If outerName exists, the inner class name usually starts with the outer class name and innerName is provided.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.769188364Z"}
{"id":"7644c06d-017f-48c9-b77c-14a1e5bbc670","expr":"result == null || name != null","rationale":"If the result is not null, the method must have delegated to cv.visitRecordComponent which typically requires a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.771089824Z"}
{"id":"2a7ca3f8-f9bf-494f-9bc0-6bd9969e61e1","expr":"result == null || descriptor != null","rationale":"If the result is not null it typically means the visit was successful and the descriptor should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.771089824Z"}
{"id":"d095a254-844b-4bb8-a244-f8ccdd63c6d4","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter identifies the record component and is expected to be a valid non-null string at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.771655870Z"}
{"id":"9baa91ff-6fc4-4cd8-a62e-9af8ea92c965","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The 'descriptor' parameter typically holds the type signature of the record component, and should not be null to describe the component's type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.771655870Z"}
{"id":"f8bc3d13-5cb5-481b-97fe-c084497499d7","expr":"signature == null || descriptor != null","rationale":"The signature being non-null implies that the descriptor should be non-null as it complements the signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.771655870Z"}
{"id":"3deb249c-1e51-4276-8d69-eb3dc5c93c89","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The 'name' of a record component should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.771655870Z"}
{"id":"edf82081-7b39-4f00-ad94-1f3cb46fc842","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter represents a field name which in Java class files is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.772681340Z"}
{"id":"e75e8281-99b2-4310-8253-4b6a1769515b","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The 'descriptor' parameter describes the type and must be non-null for valid fields.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.772681340Z"}
{"id":"d3b7cb43-8981-40cf-9d51-63e7df9b7ab0","expr":"(signature == null || signature.length() >= 0)","rationale":"The 'signature' may be null or a valid string but no negative length can occur.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.772681340Z"}
{"id":"f94b1aa9-d8f0-4014-87cd-3a7d7d5a7cc0","expr":"(value == null || true)","rationale":"The 'value' parameter represents the constant value associated with the field which can be null or any object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.772681340Z"}
{"id":"c7cfd6be-a514-4dc8-a6a5-36b177cbea33","expr":"(access & 0) == 0","rationale":"Access is an int representing bitflags; this expression shows it is defined as an int.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.772681340Z"}
{"id":"e422071a-c199-4910-bdf0-154651526d01","expr":"!result || (exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0)","rationale":"If result is non-null, exceptions may or may not be null, but it is safe to assume any array length is allowed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.780353916Z"}
{"id":"835cb56c-2663-4968-b2b2-a18c319aa411","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name should not be null as it identifies the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.791031629Z"}
{"id":"c90047eb-8497-4d5c-b013-f853928746fb","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor string represents the method descriptor and must be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.791031629Z"}
{"id":"a54d1986-930e-4e4b-9742-711268fe1824","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Exceptions may be absent but if present, length must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.791031629Z"}
{"id":"7466d9bf-c09b-4792-8a16-c9ceaa2815c0","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() >= 0","rationale":"Signature if present is a string; its length is never negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.791031629Z"}
{"id":"53c09fa2-6db7-4ea2-95f6-971bf1271708","expr":"typeDescriptor != null && typeDescriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"The method getType calls getTypeInternal with typeDescriptor and its length; to avoid an exception, typeDescriptor must be non-null and have length > 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.795280769Z"}
{"id":"5067e069-9df7-4793-a26b-603b3b4931e6","expr":"typeDescriptor.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.795280769Z"}
{"id":"1bc07043-3973-4e03-98e9-023cad4f45c2","expr":"typeDescriptor != null && result != null && result.getDescriptor().equals(typeDescriptor)","rationale":"Since getType returns a Type representing the input descriptor, then getDescriptor()==typeDescriptor must hold.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.797441337Z"}
{"id":"a13e21ad-c396-48d0-ab42-a4a2b8e723cf","expr":"typeDescriptor.length() > 0 && result.getDescriptor().length() == typeDescriptor.length()","rationale":"Method uses full length of the input string for the type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.797441337Z"}
{"id":"65589ee4-2593-4246-9e18-aef5b3021a49","expr":"!typeDescriptor.isEmpty() && result.getSort() >= 0","rationale":"A Type's sort (kind) should be a non-negative integer for valid descriptors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.797441337Z"}
{"id":"b405b960-47c4-46ef-83ff-3e66683533a2","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method is guaranteed to return a non-null Type instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Class<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.799250413Z"}
{"id":"3b0c7431-e3c0-4421-ba23-793cd27b1de5","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method performs calls on clazz, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Class<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.800160256Z"}
{"id":"18d8695b-9d96-4d5d-b0dd-31012ef288f0","expr":"constructor != null","rationale":"Method expects a non-null constructor parameter for processing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.804945756Z"}
{"id":"7d75cb28-ea86-42f3-9298-1a3f99af13ca","expr":"!constructor.isSynthetic()","rationale":"The getType method likely expects a non-synthetic constructor to compute a descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.804945756Z"}
{"id":"f8fa03ed-d790-4077-8513-27c8d4bad7cc","expr":"constructor.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"The declaring class is essential for the constructor descriptor and expected not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.804945756Z"}
{"id":"5131791f-d4f3-4406-89a7-187fa2523843","expr":"constructor.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Parameter count of a constructor is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.804945756Z"}
{"id":"b3c87e79-e58a-4725-9c06-4dda4695c476","expr":"constructor.getName() != null","rationale":"Constructor reflection API guarantees a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.804945756Z"}
{"id":"fc108a84-ac36-49a5-8781-deb1b0698a64","expr":"constructor.getParameterCount() == 0 || result.getDescriptor().contains(\"(\")","rationale":"A constructor with parameters must have a descriptor containing parentheses.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.810351203Z"}
{"id":"f54f98f1-a9d2-4772-9a4c-51ad4c37c431","expr":"!result.getInternalName().isEmpty()","rationale":"The returned Type represents a valid JVM type descriptor associated with the constructor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:44.810351203Z"}
