{"id":"0d620a4b-b08f-46cf-9921-4cbd017eab14","expr":"result == null || (end == null || result.endPc.bytecodeOffset <= end.bytecodeOffset)","rationale":"The result Handler's end label bytecodeOffset should not exceed the end argument if it is defined.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handler#removeRange(Handler,Label,Label):Handler","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:47.658884006Z"}
{"id":"de05fd1c-6af2-4d82-9fc0-c0d8ce9662db","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"The method counts elements in a linked chain and returns the count, which cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handler#getExceptionTableLength(Handler):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:47.659789771Z"}
