{"id":"866f8022-9322-416c-bab4-e3391dc002a5","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The type parameter is presumably non-null since it is forwarded to another visitTypeInsn method, which likely requires a non-null parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:47.813122606Z"}
{"id":"2465caf5-47fd-445e-be1b-03d3749a9b9e","expr":"(opcode == 187) || (opcode == 192) || (opcode == 193) || (opcode == 198) || (opcode == 199)","rationale":"Reflects that the opcode argument should be one of the opcodes that classify type instructions in ASM.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:47.813122606Z"}
