{"id":"d00b31b0-e7af-40cb-bdc9-738daa731942","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The owner string identifies the class or interface on which the method is invoked, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:47.821453350Z"}
{"id":"de947fa3-cf70-4b3a-aa47-0776b45bb787","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter is the method name to be invoked, and it should be a valid string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:47.821453350Z"}
